(151674, 7869, 1041, '<td valign="top">is this the colinder we''ve seen before?  if yes, i still like it.  nice shot, just the right combination between abstract and recognizable.  :)<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- very well done.  great DOF, especially for such a close-up.  the reflections add to the shot, as does the blue cast.<br/>composition -- great use of ROT.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'is this the colinder we''ve seen before?  if yes, i still like it.  nice shot, just the right combination between abstract and recognizable.  :)challenge -- mettechnical -- very well done.  great DOF, especially for such a close-up.  the reflections add to the shot, as does the blue cast.composition -- great use of ROT.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
