(151680, 7869, 1005, '<td valign="top">Konador - wow, this is an interesting pattern....I am blown away by the number of views this got in two days!  (almost 2700!!!! @ DeviantArt)  I am impressed!  While I like this and it is very, very well done, I''m sorry, but I don''t quite understand the outstanding attraction.  It''s really nice, wow, 2700 views.  I gotta read some of those 54 comments.  Are you doing this well here, too? <br/>I''m going with the washing machine.  Well, it''s growing on me, (maybe it''s peer pressure!) Let''s go 9.  Swash</td>', 'Konador - wow, this is an interesting pattern....I am blown away by the number of views this got in two days!  (almost 2700!!!! @ DeviantArt)  I am impressed!  While I like this and it is very, very well done, I''m sorry, but I don''t quite understand the outstanding attraction.  It''s really nice, wow, 2700 views.  I gotta read some of those 54 comments.  Are you doing this well here, too? I''m going with the washing machine.  Well, it''s growing on me, (maybe it''s peer pressure!) Let''s go 9.  Swash', '2002-11-13 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
