(151792, 7887, 5121, '<td valign="top">How long did it take you to take that shot?  Looks like the cheese has gone hard!  Only kidding, nice bit of still life!</td>', 'How long did it take you to take that shot?  Looks like the cheese has gone hard!  Only kidding, nice bit of still life!', '2002-11-16 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151793, 7887, 4648, '<td valign="top">This probably took longer than people think.  The cheese is drying out some.  Good clear, crisp (cracker?) shot.  Like the contrast of the cheese and cracker color.  Like the salt on the cracker.  Good clear shot.  Worth a 9 technically.  Has no "wow" for me.  Only thing that keep it a 9.  PTL</td>', 'This probably took longer than people think.  The cheese is drying out some.  Good clear, crisp (cracker?) shot.  Like the contrast of the cheese and cracker color.  Like the salt on the cracker.  Good clear shot.  Worth a 9 technically.  Has no "wow" for me.  Only thing that keep it a 9.  PTL', '2002-11-16 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151794, 7887, 2370, '<td valign="top">some side lighting on the cheese could improve this image further, but it is quite artisitc.</td>', 'some side lighting on the cheese could improve this image further, but it is quite artisitc.', '2002-11-17 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151795, 7887, 472, '<td valign="top">i thought this was a nice take on an everday subject. : )</td>', 'i thought this was a nice take on an everday subject. : )', '2002-11-18 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(151796, 7888, 3080, '<td valign="top">The DOF is paper thin on this.  Not nesessarily a bad thing though.  The part that is in focus is in very nice focus.  I think though that I might like to see a tad more in focus though.  Just my personal opinion.  A bit of bright light intrudes in on the focused part, taking away a bit of the detail.  I love the angle and framing/cropping.  A nice guitar for sure. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The DOF is paper thin on this.  Not nesessarily a bad thing though.  The part that is in focus is in very nice focus.  I think though that I might like to see a tad more in focus though.  Just my personal opinion.  A bit of bright light intrudes in on the focused part, taking away a bit of the detail.  I love the angle and framing/cropping.  A nice guitar for sure. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151797, 7888, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting. Very artistic.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting. Very artistic.', '2002-11-11 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
