(151837, 7895, 741, '<td valign="top">Focusing doesn''t quite work here.  The clip on the AltGR key is fairly sharp but the rest aren''t and it makes the picture look disorganised.  The points of interest for the eye are (1) the brightest part (which isn''t in focus) and (2) the point of sharp focus (which is in a very odd place).  Background is also confusing - whay a laptop?</td>', 'Focusing doesn''t quite work here.  The clip on the AltGR key is fairly sharp but the rest aren''t and it makes the picture look disorganised.  The points of interest for the eye are (1) the brightest part (which isn''t in focus) and (2) the point of sharp focus (which is in a very odd place).  Background is also confusing - whay a laptop?', '2002-11-12 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
