(151917, 7900, 811, '<td valign="top">I am so jealous.  I tried this same thing several weeks ago with a strawberry.  Never could get the crazy thing in focus, or to show such nice stopped motion.  The pink cookie adds nice color (though i like the yellow ones better -- pink works better for the picture :-P ).  Awesome shot. 10 -- karmat</td>', 'I am so jealous.  I tried this same thing several weeks ago with a strawberry.  Never could get the crazy thing in focus, or to show such nice stopped motion.  The pink cookie adds nice color (though i like the yellow ones better -- pink works better for the picture :-P ).  Awesome shot. 10 -- karmat', '2002-11-15 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151918, 7900, 2011, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail didnt do this shot justice. A definate winner in my view. 10 boyte1</td>', 'The thumbnail didnt do this shot justice. A definate winner in my view. 10 boyte1', '2002-11-16 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
