(151942, 7904, 4648, '<td valign="top">Loks like a beautiful well made, well preserved, antique toy.  Realize the driver is your photo but I would have liked to see the entire toy in sharp focus.  If I''m right as to what it is have you taken it to "Antique Road Show" to have it valued?  Can''t give it more than a 5 with only the driver in focus.  Should put a clear picture of the whole thing in.  PTL</td>', 'Loks like a beautiful well made, well preserved, antique toy.  Realize the driver is your photo but I would have liked to see the entire toy in sharp focus.  If I''m right as to what it is have you taken it to "Antique Road Show" to have it valued?  Can''t give it more than a 5 with only the driver in focus.  Should put a clear picture of the whole thing in.  PTL', '2002-11-13 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
