(151951, 7905, 3080, '<td valign="top">A rather confusing shot to me.  If the main subject is the huge lens dead center, than I think that the people are distracting, and need to be blurred out.  I understand that not all cameras have DOF, so if not, not a huge deal.  They are still distracting though.  lighting seems good, and the focus on the lens seems ok, but Im still not sure I''m seeing this right.  To me, the people look like a reflection in a glass, or window that this dark lens is encased in.  Not really sure though. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'A rather confusing shot to me.  If the main subject is the huge lens dead center, than I think that the people are distracting, and need to be blurred out.  I understand that not all cameras have DOF, so if not, not a huge deal.  They are still distracting though.  lighting seems good, and the focus on the lens seems ok, but Im still not sure I''m seeing this right.  To me, the people look like a reflection in a glass, or window that this dark lens is encased in.  Not really sure though. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151952, 7905, 4297, '<td valign="top">this would of been a 5 normally, but the title and the fact it made me laugh has boosted it to a 7.. nice one!!!!</td>', 'this would of been a 5 normally, but the title and the fact it made me laugh has boosted it to a 7.. nice one!!!!', '2002-11-11 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
