(151959, 7905, 1041, '<td valign="top">hahaha, funny, but for the challenge it''s a stretch, i think.  oh well.<br/>technical -- overall, the photo needs to be a little more sharp and crisp, i think.<br/>composition -- your subject is centered in the middle, the two guys'' heads are cut off by it and there''s a lot of stuff going on in the background ... it''s hard to take these kind of shots where you can''t control the environment, i know. <br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'hahaha, funny, but for the challenge it''s a stretch, i think.  oh well.technical -- overall, the photo needs to be a little more sharp and crisp, i think.composition -- your subject is centered in the middle, the two guys'' heads are cut off by it and there''s a lot of stuff going on in the background ... it''s hard to take these kind of shots where you can''t control the environment, i know. -- gr8photos.', '2002-11-13 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151960, 7905, 3900, '<td valign="top">Looks like a friendship festival at a military base, or something similar.  I''m curious as to how you got that particular effect, though.</td>', 'Looks like a friendship festival at a military base, or something similar.  I''m curious as to how you got that particular effect, though.', '2002-11-14 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
