(151962, 7905, 806, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry.. I just don''t get this photo. What are you trying to say? I will read the details after the challenge is over, and hope there are comments there to explain.</td>', 'I''m sorry.. I just don''t get this photo. What are you trying to say? I will read the details after the challenge is over, and hope there are comments there to explain.', '2002-11-17 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151963, 7906, 518, '<td valign="top">focus please</td>', 'focus please', '2002-11-11 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151964, 7906, 1041, '<td valign="top">i bet you are having a hard time competing with the real lizards and frogs.  but nice subject anyway.<br/>challenge -- met.  although, there''s nothing in the photo that gives me an indication of actual size (this sculpture could be huge) i will give you the benefit of the doubt.<br/>technical -- since macro only allows a shallow DOF on digicams, i think you''ve chosen your focus nicely.  i wonder if you get comments that the face should be in focus.  i like it as it is.  there are some highlights, especially on the foot that is in focus that are a little distracting and i''m not sure about the background going from white to black, but that''s just my personal preference.<br/>composition -- nice cropping.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'i bet you are having a hard time competing with the real lizards and frogs.  but nice subject anyway.challenge -- met.  although, there''s nothing in the photo that gives me an indication of actual size (this sculpture could be huge) i will give you the benefit of the doubt.technical -- since macro only allows a shallow DOF on digicams, i think you''ve chosen your focus nicely.  i wonder if you get comments that the face should be in focus.  i like it as it is.  there are some highlights, especially on the foot that is in focus that are a little distracting and i''m not sure about the background going from white to black, but that''s just my personal preference.composition -- nice cropping.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(151965, 7906, 3540, '<td valign="top">Seems odd IMO to focus on the arm of this subject vs. the head.  Bottom of the arm that is in focus is a bit washed out.  I think the lighting is ok, but the framing is not what I would do myself.  Doesn''t make me right either, just because I said so but this is what I think. - Inspzil</td>', 'Seems odd IMO to focus on the arm of this subject vs. the head.  Bottom of the arm that is in focus is a bit washed out.  I think the lighting is ok, but the framing is not what I would do myself.  Doesn''t make me right either, just because I said so but this is what I think. - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
