(152010, 7911, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very good choice of subject for this challenge.  I actually thought about doing this one myself :)  The image is suffering a little pixellation.. .maybe from enlarging?  Also, I believe that, in an image like this, your focus should probalby be in the foreground rather than in the rear of the image... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a very good choice of subject for this challenge.  I actually thought about doing this one myself :)  The image is suffering a little pixellation.. .maybe from enlarging?  Also, I believe that, in an image like this, your focus should probalby be in the foreground rather than in the rear of the image... good work :) - setzler', '2002-11-14 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
