(152012, 7911, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical --  the image doesn''t look 100% sharp to me, maybe it''s just the light reflections.  tough one to reduce them on the shiny wrappings, i know.<br/>composition -- i like that you''ve almost filled the frame with the kisses and that some are cropped at the edges.  i would try to totally hide the basket, but that''s probably just me.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical --  the image doesn''t look 100% sharp to me, maybe it''s just the light reflections.  tough one to reduce them on the shiny wrappings, i know.composition -- i like that you''ve almost filled the frame with the kisses and that some are cropped at the edges.  i would try to totally hide the basket, but that''s probably just me.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-14 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
