(152091, 7918, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.. i expect to see it in the top 3 this week.  I love the abstract nature of it and the blue here is just incredible... This looks like something I would expect to see in outer space... or in some science fiction movie :)  the orientation of this photo lends itself very well to the abstract nature of it... as for improvements, i can''t really think of any other than possibly trying a darker setting... great shot :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great photo.. i expect to see it in the top 3 this week.  I love the abstract nature of it and the blue here is just incredible... This looks like something I would expect to see in outer space... or in some science fiction movie :)  the orientation of this photo lends itself very well to the abstract nature of it... as for improvements, i can''t really think of any other than possibly trying a darker setting... great shot :) = 10 - setzler', '2002-11-12 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152092, 7918, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the color and the composition and focus are first rate!  One of the best this week. DPz</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the color and the composition and focus are first rate!  One of the best this week. DPz', '2002-11-12 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
