(152095, 7918, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is one of those I don''t know what it is but it is beautiful.  Not knowing doesn''t affect me at all.  The color is outstanding, the focus is great the uniqueness is great.  I''ve never given a 10 to an "I don''t know" but I must this time because of the quality of the photo.  Congratulations.  This will be in my favorites.  PTL  This is a one of a kind.  Congratulations to a job well done.</td>', 'This is one of those I don''t know what it is but it is beautiful.  Not knowing doesn''t affect me at all.  The color is outstanding, the focus is great the uniqueness is great.  I''ve never given a 10 to an "I don''t know" but I must this time because of the quality of the photo.  Congratulations.  This will be in my favorites.  PTL  This is a one of a kind.  Congratulations to a job well done.', '2002-11-13 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
