(152114, 7918, 1143, '<td valign="top">I don''t really think there''s much to explain once you know that it is glass, but I''m glad that people liked it. I had thought about doing bubbles and then realized that these candle holders had really cool bubbles in them. The trick was getting them in focus and lit well. Unfortunately, they reflected EVERYTHING in the room, but I was the only person. The brown thing on the right side is a cardboard box.</td>', 'I don''t really think there''s much to explain once you know that it is glass, but I''m glad that people liked it. I had thought about doing bubbles and then realized that these candle holders had really cool bubbles in them. The trick was getting them in focus and lit well. Unfortunately, they reflected EVERYTHING in the room, but I was the only person. The brown thing on the right side is a cardboard box.', '2002-11-18 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(152115, 7920, 5047, '<td valign="top">How is this a macro/closeup?  It looks pretty far away...  Plus the haze doesn''t help, sorry...</td>', 'How is this a macro/closeup?  It looks pretty far away...  Plus the haze doesn''t help, sorry...', '2002-11-11 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
