(152143, 7920, 4648, '<td valign="top">Illegially close or extra large lens?  Still don''t think this is macro, up close and personal, or any of the challenge.  But sure is a mighty good picture.  I like the picture.  Wish I was voting on it alone - without anything to do with the challenge.  Darn it, still going to give it a 6 cause I like it.  PTL</td>', 'Illegially close or extra large lens?  Still don''t think this is macro, up close and personal, or any of the challenge.  But sure is a mighty good picture.  I like the picture.  Wish I was voting on it alone - without anything to do with the challenge.  Darn it, still going to give it a 6 cause I like it.  PTL', '2002-11-14 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
