(152168, 7922, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great job of pulling out the quote.  Clear and concise and to the point.  Good use of B &amp; W.  Background a little dark for me but other wise it''s a fine 9.  Nice change to the money use.  Great subject matter.  Not only in 90 but in 02 also.  PTL</td>', 'Great job of pulling out the quote.  Clear and concise and to the point.  Good use of B & W.  Background a little dark for me but other wise it''s a fine 9.  Nice change to the money use.  Great subject matter.  Not only in 90 but in 02 also.  PTL', '2002-11-14 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
