(152173, 7923, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met.  the trunk of the yukka gives a good sense of perspective.<br/>technical -- the focus isn''t quite right, that''s the hardest thing with macros.  i would also prefer more even lighting, but that''s probably a personal preference.  i like the green of the shoot against the brown of the trunk.<br/>composition -- good placement of the shoot in the overall frame.  did you try this in a vertical format at all?  the shoot feels somewhat closed in because it''s so close the the top and bottom of the frame.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- met.  the trunk of the yukka gives a good sense of perspective.technical -- the focus isn''t quite right, that''s the hardest thing with macros.  i would also prefer more even lighting, but that''s probably a personal preference.  i like the green of the shoot against the brown of the trunk.composition -- good placement of the shoot in the overall frame.  did you try this in a vertical format at all?  the shoot feels somewhat closed in because it''s so close the the top and bottom of the frame.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152174, 7923, 5023, '<td valign="top">like the lighting</td>', 'like the lighting', '2002-11-11 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152175, 7923, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.</td>', 'Very nice photo.', '2002-11-12 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152176, 7923, 3454, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice if the green leaves where in focus.</td>', 'Would have been nice if the green leaves where in focus.', '2002-11-13 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152177, 7923, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great Yukka plant.  But they sure get sharp when full grown.  A little off center for me.  The dark area should have been partly cropped off putting the new plant closer to middle, to suit me personally.  A little soft on the new plant and sharper on the old part.  Would prefer reversed.  Still a good strong 5.  PTL</td>', 'Great Yukka plant.  But they sure get sharp when full grown.  A little off center for me.  The dark area should have been partly cropped off putting the new plant closer to middle, to suit me personally.  A little soft on the new plant and sharper on the old part.  Would prefer reversed.  Still a good strong 5.  PTL', '2002-11-13 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152178, 7923, 4764, '<td valign="top">Might have worked better if the green was in focus, not the other part -hector</td>', 'Might have worked better if the green was in focus, not the other part -hector', '2002-11-14 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152179, 7923, 4906, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments in a busy week. I must admit I wasn''t entirely happy with the focus or the lighting on this picture. Seems that the lighting was very much a personal preference, from the comments received.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments in a busy week. I must admit I wasn''t entirely happy with the focus or the lighting on this picture. Seems that the lighting was very much a personal preference, from the comments received.', '2002-11-18 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
