(152183, 7926, 3540, '<td valign="top">If we had a digital art type site, I would''nt hesitate to give this a 10 hands down.  Even if you can do this on your camera without the post processing, I still don''t agree with it.  This is a nice image, perhaps panning back a bit would help.  It just doesn''t have the punch that a real looking photograph would have, IMO - Inspzil</td>', 'If we had a digital art type site, I would''nt hesitate to give this a 10 hands down.  Even if you can do this on your camera without the post processing, I still don''t agree with it.  This is a nice image, perhaps panning back a bit would help.  It just doesn''t have the punch that a real looking photograph would have, IMO - Inspzil', '2002-11-12 05:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
