(152261, 7931, 1827, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is great, but I like it 100% better even, if it is cropped just above the "spine" of the feather.  Of course, that would not meet current dpc requirements, but it still would be dynamite.  Just my thoughts.  Take what you can use and disregard the rest.  8, just-married</td>', 'I think this photo is great, but I like it 100% better even, if it is cropped just above the "spine" of the feather.  Of course, that would not meet current dpc requirements, but it still would be dynamite.  Just my thoughts.  Take what you can use and disregard the rest.  8, just-married', '2002-11-16 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152262, 7931, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail -- looks like you could touch it.</td>', 'Great lighting and detail -- looks like you could touch it.', '2002-11-17 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152263, 7931, 2221, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting! It shows the texture very well. Good job! -stephan</td>', 'Excellent lighting! It shows the texture very well. Good job! -stephan', '2002-11-17 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152264, 7931, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting.</td>', 'Good use of lighting.', '2002-11-17 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152265, 7931, 2148, '<td valign="top">Once again, thank you to everyone that took the time to comment. Many people commented  on the lighting. I have to admit I was pleasently surprised how this image turned out as there was no lighting to speak of, just the over head light in the room. I was really only setting this up to see what it came out like with a view to tweaking the lighting and playing around with various lamps etc afterwoods. As it turned out it didn''t need it. As with ''asleep'' which used a torch and ''a new addiction'' which used a mini maglite, I guess it shows that fancy lighting isn''t always needed. BTW, the image is not B&amp;W it''s full colour - that was the colour of the feather, the lighting along the edges is also the colour of the feather and not added by any lighting.</td>', 'Once again, thank you to everyone that took the time to comment. Many people commented  on the lighting. I have to admit I was pleasently surprised how this image turned out as there was no lighting to speak of, just the over head light in the room. I was really only setting this up to see what it came out like with a view to tweaking the lighting and playing around with various lamps etc afterwoods. As it turned out it didn''t need it. As with ''asleep'' which used a torch and ''a new addiction'' which used a mini maglite, I guess it shows that fancy lighting isn''t always needed. BTW, the image is not B&W it''s full colour - that was the colour of the feather, the lighting along the edges is also the colour of the feather and not added by any lighting.', '2002-11-22 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(152266, 7932, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. 10</td>', 'Nicely done. 10', '2002-11-11 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152267, 7932, 4472, '<td valign="top">Well done coin, good contast and not over exposed</td>', 'Well done coin, good contast and not over exposed', '2002-11-11 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152268, 7932, 327, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot. Justine. Bravo</td>', 'Good macro shot. Justine. Bravo', '2002-11-11 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
