(152277, 7932, 4177, '<td valign="top">This is a starkly compelling picture, but the dime appears ellipsoid when one would expect it to appear perfectly round. I think that detracts from the overall effect. (Not by much, however.) Is this a proof coin?</td>', 'This is a starkly compelling picture, but the dime appears ellipsoid when one would expect it to appear perfectly round. I think that detracts from the overall effect. (Not by much, however.) Is this a proof coin?', '2002-11-13 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
