(152297, 7933, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat''s eye.  Beautiful green, but what is reflected blue in it?  Besides the beauty of the eye I like how you can see the difference in the fur.  The short real soft white  across the birdge flowing to the thicker over top of the evy.  Very good focus.  Not easy to get fur focused that well..  Good crop job.  Solid 8  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful cat''s eye.  Beautiful green, but what is reflected blue in it?  Besides the beauty of the eye I like how you can see the difference in the fur.  The short real soft white  across the birdge flowing to the thicker over top of the evy.  Very good focus.  Not easy to get fur focused that well..  Good crop job.  Solid 8  PTL', '2002-11-13 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152298, 7933, 714, '<td valign="top">This cat does not look very happy.  Good close up.  8 Sonifo</td>', 'This cat does not look very happy.  Good close up.  8 Sonifo', '2002-11-13 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
