(152326, 7936, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, maybe a touch more focus in order.  I really wish he wasn''t on that same color leaf though.  DPz</td>', 'Nice shot, maybe a touch more focus in order.  I really wish he wasn''t on that same color leaf though.  DPz', '2002-11-12 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152327, 7936, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met.  the leaves give a nice sense of scale to this photo.<br/>technical -- doesn''t seem to be quite a sharp as it could be ... have you saved this at a higher resolution?<br/>composition -- i like the orange and green shades of this photo.  at the same time, the lizard blends into the background a bit more than i would like to see.  guess i can''t have both  :)<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- met.  the leaves give a nice sense of scale to this photo.technical -- doesn''t seem to be quite a sharp as it could be ... have you saved this at a higher resolution?composition -- i like the orange and green shades of this photo.  at the same time, the lizard blends into the background a bit more than i would like to see.  guess i can''t have both  :)-- gr8photos', '2002-11-13 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152328, 7936, 4648, '<td valign="top">What happened to his tail?  But I''m not going to knock off on that account.  He seems to run on leaves matching his color.  Good shot of his.  Can''t tell if it is in water or not.  Third rule works here real well.  Tech out at about 7 but doesn''t have the "wow" because of his color with the leaves for me.  Still good photo.  6 is real good for this.  PTL</td>', 'What happened to his tail?  But I''m not going to knock off on that account.  He seems to run on leaves matching his color.  Good shot of his.  Can''t tell if it is in water or not.  Third rule works here real well.  Tech out at about 7 but doesn''t have the "wow" because of his color with the leaves for me.  Still good photo.  6 is real good for this.  PTL', '2002-11-14 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152329, 7936, 4430, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful colors, I just wish that he was more in focus.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful colors, I just wish that he was more in focus.', '2002-11-15 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152330, 7938, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the colors.</td>', 'Nice shot, love the colors.', '2002-11-11 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152331, 7938, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.  Don''t get too close</td>', 'Very Nice.  Don''t get too close', '2002-11-11 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152332, 7938, 3540, '<td valign="top">An object this centered should be taken much closer, or cropped in much closer.  The photo is pretty good, but the shallow DOF of macro does not lend itself to having foreground images this much closer than the subject.  On the brighter side, it is a good capture and the subject is in good focus.  Overall the image would be much better if the framing was changed. - Inspzil</td>', 'An object this centered should be taken much closer, or cropped in much closer.  The photo is pretty good, but the shallow DOF of macro does not lend itself to having foreground images this much closer than the subject.  On the brighter side, it is a good capture and the subject is in good focus.  Overall the image would be much better if the framing was changed. - Inspzil', '2002-11-11 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152333, 7938, 327, '<td valign="top">love the two main colors.....wow.</td>', 'love the two main colors.....wow.', '2002-11-11 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
