(152352, 7939, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot really appeals to me.  Love your composition and your lighting;  it is simple, crisp and clear, and you almost feel like you could touch the cotton.  Lovely. lhall</td>', 'This shot really appeals to me.  Love your composition and your lighting;  it is simple, crisp and clear, and you almost feel like you could touch the cotton.  Lovely. lhall', '2002-11-12 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
