(152368, 7940, 3669, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is a really nice shot.  Great focus on the arm of the chair and the lighting is fine.  You were able to pick up the texture of the fabric nicely.  However, the subject matter is a bit drab.  You probably could have cropped closer to the left of the chair arm to get rid of the white space at the top left</td>', 'Technically, this is a really nice shot.  Great focus on the arm of the chair and the lighting is fine.  You were able to pick up the texture of the fabric nicely.  However, the subject matter is a bit drab.  You probably could have cropped closer to the left of the chair arm to get rid of the white space at the top left', '2002-11-13 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152369, 7940, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good focus on the arm, nice texture shot, but low interest (at least in my case).  6 Swash</td>', 'Very good focus on the arm, nice texture shot, but low interest (at least in my case).  6 Swash', '2002-11-14 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
