(152441, 7945, 3080, '<td valign="top">ahhh grosss!!  absolutely amazing photo!! a microscope shot I assume.  That is one creepy looking sucker.  I can only imagine how tough this was to get, and I hate to complain about anything, but I do with that the focus was just a tad sharper.  Still an amazing shot.  The detail has not been compromised.  Great close up. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'ahhh grosss!!  absolutely amazing photo!! a microscope shot I assume.  That is one creepy looking sucker.  I can only imagine how tough this was to get, and I hate to complain about anything, but I do with that the focus was just a tad sharper.  Still an amazing shot.  The detail has not been compromised.  Great close up. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
