(152474, 7946, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed. The coloures are working great together and the focus is perfect! I made a similar shot for this challenge, but decided finally to submit an other one. It would have been the 3rd zipper shot ;-). Voted 9 - nds</td>', 'Nice idea and well executed. The coloures are working great together and the focus is perfect! I made a similar shot for this challenge, but decided finally to submit an other one. It would have been the 3rd zipper shot ;-). Voted 9 - nds', '2002-11-13 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
