(152478, 7946, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not what I would have expected.  Surprised there were 2 of you.  Only the title is different.  Great shot.  Are to boxers red?  Just wondered.  I see a little red.  Good job.  6  PTL</td>', 'Not what I would have expected.  Surprised there were 2 of you.  Only the title is different.  Great shot.  Are to boxers red?  Just wondered.  I see a little red.  Good job.  6  PTL', '2002-11-14 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
