(152493, 7949, 3540, '<td valign="top">Pretty well done.  Lots of noise in the background.   I''m guessing this was a long exposure, and all the "noise" is just dust.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Pretty well done.  Lots of noise in the background.   I''m guessing this was a long exposure, and all the "noise" is just dust.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
