(152504, 7950, 1073, '<td valign="top">I am sure I am not the only one to ask what is it. If I dont know what i am looking<br/>at i can not vote right. I persume that you invest time to create it so I must score it 2<br/>amnon</td>', 'I am sure I am not the only one to ask what is it. If I dont know what i am lookingat i can not vote right. I persume that you invest time to create it so I must score it 2amnon', '2002-11-11 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
