(152507, 7950, 4648, '<td valign="top">This must be something technical but I''m not sure what.  Only the middle 2 silver pieces are anywhere close to being in focus.  I hate to give a 2 but I can''t really go any more than that.  Better luck next time.  PTL</td>', 'This must be something technical but I''m not sure what.  Only the middle 2 silver pieces are anywhere close to being in focus.  I hate to give a 2 but I can''t really go any more than that.  Better luck next time.  PTL', '2002-11-13 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
