(152511, 7951, 3479, '<td valign="top">sorry but i think this photo is in need of a lot of improvement.  you know what you want to shoot, so why the hand?, and why in the shade?  do try it again, these are really pretty flowers</td>', 'sorry but i think this photo is in need of a lot of improvement.  you know what you want to shoot, so why the hand?, and why in the shade?  do try it again, these are really pretty flowers', '2002-11-12 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
