(152671, 7967, 4648, '<td valign="top">When you can see the hair on a fly''s legs you can''t get much better than that.  I, personally, would have prefered some color than all that green.  I know the others will pick it apart but I love it.  Right now it''s a 9.  I''ll have to think about the green more before Sunday.  PTL</td>', 'When you can see the hair on a fly''s legs you can''t get much better than that.  I, personally, would have prefered some color than all that green.  I know the others will pick it apart but I love it.  Right now it''s a 9.  I''ll have to think about the green more before Sunday.  PTL', '2002-11-12 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
