(152684, 7969, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, creative. I''m not crazy for the crop...cut the bottom off. Light is a bit over-exposed also. Still all in all I really do like this....works for me. Justine</td>', 'Neat shot, creative. I''m not crazy for the crop...cut the bottom off. Light is a bit over-exposed also. Still all in all I really do like this....works for me. Justine', '2002-11-11 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
