(152688, 7969, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Can almost see the rust flaking off but the background is too busy and overrules the who photo.  Ruins it .  Takes it from a 9 all the way down to a 3.  You had such a good idea, too.  But 3 is really a stretch for me.  Sorry.  PTL</td>', 'Good idea.  Can almost see the rust flaking off but the background is too busy and overrules the who photo.  Ruins it .  Takes it from a 9 all the way down to a 3.  You had such a good idea, too.  But 3 is really a stretch for me.  Sorry.  PTL', '2002-11-13 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152689, 7969, 1255, '<td valign="top">Fantastic textures on this!  Too bad the screws are both cut off, I feel this detracts from the photo.</td>', 'Fantastic textures on this!  Too bad the screws are both cut off, I feel this detracts from the photo.', '2002-11-13 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
