(152705, 7973, 772, '<td valign="top">I really love this setting... this photo is quite nice :)  The mood here and the soft lighting create a nice ''antique'' sense... for some reason, i think the opposing diagonals created by the books and the table patterns... EXCELLENT work... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'I really love this setting... this photo is quite nice :)  The mood here and the soft lighting create a nice ''antique'' sense... for some reason, i think the opposing diagonals created by the books and the table patterns... EXCELLENT work... = 10 - setzler', '2002-11-12 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152706, 7973, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Would never have thought you could get so many things in without making it too busy, but you succeded.  This is really neat.  I''m glad you left it in color, especially since they are the color they are.  Great shot.  Very clear and sharp.  Well cropped.  Superb job.  High 9.  PTL</td>', 'Great composition.  Would never have thought you could get so many things in without making it too busy, but you succeded.  This is really neat.  I''m glad you left it in color, especially since they are the color they are.  Great shot.  Very clear and sharp.  Well cropped.  Superb job.  High 9.  PTL', '2002-11-13 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
