(152710, 7973, 4811, '<td valign="top">Favorite pic of the week. From the arrangement of all the elements, to the colors and lighting... excellent shot.</td>', 'Favorite pic of the week. From the arrangement of all the elements, to the colors and lighting... excellent shot.', '2002-11-14 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
