(152732, 7974, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- i would like to se more tonal range in the hands, the only really bright spot in this photo is the background and there it''s slightly distracting.  i do like your choice of b&amp;w very much, and that the hands are of slightly different tones.<br/>composition -- hand positions are great, not too sure about background, but can''t quite put my finger on (no pun intended) what i would try differently.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- i would like to se more tonal range in the hands, the only really bright spot in this photo is the background and there it''s slightly distracting.  i do like your choice of b&w very much, and that the hands are of slightly different tones.composition -- hand positions are great, not too sure about background, but can''t quite put my finger on (no pun intended) what i would try differently.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-12 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
