(152734, 7974, 4648, '<td valign="top">As they wipe the tears from their eyes to vote ......  they are torn.  Do I vote for the sentiment or the quality.  For some the sentiment wins and they score it an 8, for the others who don''t like the shadow in the bottom corner and too bright of light right above the shadow at the finger or the texture of the paper towels they give it a 6 or seven.  7 if the sentiment slips in.  PTL (a sentimental fool)</td>', 'As they wipe the tears from their eyes to vote ......  they are torn.  Do I vote for the sentiment or the quality.  For some the sentiment wins and they score it an 8, for the others who don''t like the shadow in the bottom corner and too bright of light right above the shadow at the finger or the texture of the paper towels they give it a 6 or seven.  7 if the sentiment slips in.  PTL (a sentimental fool)', '2002-11-12 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
