(152758, 7977, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that the ruler is there to show the small size of the "statue".  I would have much preferred to see the focus be on the statue, emphasizing IT as the subject instead of the ruler.  lhall</td>', 'I am assuming that the ruler is there to show the small size of the "statue".  I would have much preferred to see the focus be on the statue, emphasizing IT as the subject instead of the ruler.  lhall', '2002-11-12 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
