(152843, 7982, 4648, '<td valign="top">I believe you and you may have suckered me in.  But I really like the texture of this animal.  Unique eye.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen one like that.  Also the coloring is awesome.  a couple of focus flaws on the right but who cares.  This is a good 8 anytime.  PTL</td>', 'I believe you and you may have suckered me in.  But I really like the texture of this animal.  Unique eye.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen one like that.  Also the coloring is awesome.  a couple of focus flaws on the right but who cares.  This is a good 8 anytime.  PTL', '2002-11-14 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152844, 7982, 1280, '<td valign="top">Dunno if it is indeed an octopus, but it''s pretty cool!   Seems to be grainy, but maybe the subject IS grainy...lol  Good job!  Grayce</td>', 'Dunno if it is indeed an octopus, but it''s pretty cool!   Seems to be grainy, but maybe the subject IS grainy...lol  Good job!  Grayce', '2002-11-14 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
