(152846, 7982, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very neat pic.  I love the way the eye just stands out from the rest of the pic.  It has a really cool 3d look to it.  The only thing I question on this pic is the framing, if it could be moved a little to one side or the other.  I think it would improve the pic, but that''s my opinion. - Inspzil</td>', 'Very neat pic.  I love the way the eye just stands out from the rest of the pic.  It has a really cool 3d look to it.  The only thing I question on this pic is the framing, if it could be moved a little to one side or the other.  I think it would improve the pic, but that''s my opinion. - Inspzil', '2002-11-15 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152847, 7982, 5121, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, good picture.  Almost expect that eye to open at any moment!</td>', 'Nice colours, good picture.  Almost expect that eye to open at any moment!', '2002-11-16 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152848, 7984, 3859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but not my definition of macro.  Perhaps if you focused very closely on part of his face--- his smile or eyes, maybe.</td>', 'Nice shot, but not my definition of macro.  Perhaps if you focused very closely on part of his face--- his smile or eyes, maybe.', '2002-11-11 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
