(152851, 7984, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not a bad black and white photo. The eyes are kind of lost in the grey. Something to lighten them a bit may have helped draw my attention to his eyes.</td>', 'Not a bad black and white photo. The eyes are kind of lost in the grey. Something to lighten them a bit may have helped draw my attention to his eyes.', '2002-11-11 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
