(152855, 7984, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know people are tired of cute kids but I never tire of them , especially if the photo is good and this one is good.  Technically you nailed it.  Good choice  of B &amp; W.  Good solid 8.  PTL</td>', 'I know people are tired of cute kids but I never tire of them , especially if the photo is good and this one is good.  Technically you nailed it.  Good choice  of B & W.  Good solid 8.  PTL', '2002-11-13 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
