(152885, 7987, 772, '<td valign="top">I ain''t never seen no watch like that before.  I see that it is swiss made though... are u too chicken to buy american these days? I don'' t know about their watches, but their cheez is very good.  I put it on my sammiches almost every day.   That girl on the cocoa packages is pretty cute too... The proper way to photograph a watch is with the time set to 10:10:35 also.  Another thing i can''t figger out... how the hell can u tell what time it is since this watch ain''t got no numbers on it?  I would have at least took a pitcher of a watch that u could actually use to tell time with.  = 10 - setzler</td>', 'I ain''t never seen no watch like that before.  I see that it is swiss made though... are u too chicken to buy american these days? I don'' t know about their watches, but their cheez is very good.  I put it on my sammiches almost every day.   That girl on the cocoa packages is pretty cute too... The proper way to photograph a watch is with the time set to 10:10:35 also.  Another thing i can''t figger out... how the hell can u tell what time it is since this watch ain''t got no numbers on it?  I would have at least took a pitcher of a watch that u could actually use to tell time with.  = 10 - setzler', '2002-11-11 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152886, 7987, 3506, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Excellent focus and perfect subject for B&amp;W.  I like the watch too.  I''m going to try to look that up to see what type it is.  I''ve never seen curved LCD displays on watches before.  :)   (7)<br/><br/>Yikes!  I just found the Tag Heuer Kirium Formula 1 watch on the internet....$1470.  That''s just a little out of my price range.  :)</td>', 'Great shot.  Excellent focus and perfect subject for B&W.  I like the watch too.  I''m going to try to look that up to see what type it is.  I''ve never seen curved LCD displays on watches before.  :)   (7)Yikes!  I just found the Tag Heuer Kirium Formula 1 watch on the internet....$1470.  That''s just a little out of my price range.  :)', '2002-11-11 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(152887, 7987, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met, really nice and close up.<br/>technical -- b&amp;w works well here, you controlled your lighting very well, except for maybe some on the hands, but the impact of that is diminished by it being b&amp;w.<br/>composition -- like the way you cropped it.  don''t like the hands being opposite of each other and creating one line, but that''s minor and nitpicky.<br/>good photo!<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- met, really nice and close up.technical -- b&w works well here, you controlled your lighting very well, except for maybe some on the hands, but the impact of that is diminished by it being b&w.composition -- like the way you cropped it.  don''t like the hands being opposite of each other and creating one line, but that''s minor and nitpicky.good photo!-- gr8photos', '2002-11-12 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
