(152917, 7989, 1041, '<td valign="top">very cool :)<br/>challenge -- met.  even though the shot doesn''t give me any kind of point of reference as to the actual size of the @, i''m giving you the benefit of the doubt here.  what is this i''m looking at? <br/>technical -- nicely done, i would love to see the background just a little more white, but then i have this thing for perfectly white backgrounds.  nice focus, DOF and color otherwise.<br/>composition -- i like the angle you have used here.  it definitely adds to the shot.  <br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'very cool :)challenge -- met.  even though the shot doesn''t give me any kind of point of reference as to the actual size of the @, i''m giving you the benefit of the doubt here.  what is this i''m looking at? technical -- nicely done, i would love to see the background just a little more white, but then i have this thing for perfectly white backgrounds.  nice focus, DOF and color otherwise.composition -- i like the angle you have used here.  it definitely adds to the shot.  -- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
