(153055, 8006, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t really figure this one out.  It looks like it could''ve fit in other challenges - such as reflection or suspensed or illusions or something.  It looks caved in on the front and that''s what caught my eye in the thumbnail.  Makes it not look like a tomatoe.  I see the 1/3''s but that doesn''t appeal here.  The color is beautiful.  The focus is so soft it almost looks out of focus.  It''s rather dar and a little too much dead space for me.  But overall it is between a 5 and 6.  I''m just not sure which.  Right now its a 5.  Will look at it again later.  PTL</td>', 'Can''t really figure this one out.  It looks like it could''ve fit in other challenges - such as reflection or suspensed or illusions or something.  It looks caved in on the front and that''s what caught my eye in the thumbnail.  Makes it not look like a tomatoe.  I see the 1/3''s but that doesn''t appeal here.  The color is beautiful.  The focus is so soft it almost looks out of focus.  It''s rather dar and a little too much dead space for me.  But overall it is between a 5 and 6.  I''m just not sure which.  Right now its a 5.  Will look at it again later.  PTL', '2002-11-16 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
