(153084, 8012, 2716, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  The best spide shot this week.  Great focus.  9   Jacko</td>', 'Sweet.  The best spide shot this week.  Great focus.  9   Jacko', '2002-11-14 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153085, 8012, 1827, '<td valign="top">OMG!  SCARY!!!!  Great job getting in so close though.  You''ve got more guts than me.  I love how you captured her actually spinning the web.  So, what kinda spider is this?  7, just-married</td>', 'OMG!  SCARY!!!!  Great job getting in so close though.  You''ve got more guts than me.  I love how you captured her actually spinning the web.  So, what kinda spider is this?  7, just-married', '2002-11-16 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153086, 8012, 5121, '<td valign="top">Took some guts to take this shot, or was it behind glass?  Nice sheen on the spiders body!</td>', 'Took some guts to take this shot, or was it behind glass?  Nice sheen on the spiders body!', '2002-11-17 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153087, 8012, 4610, '<td valign="top">I hope you killed this after taking the picture!!!, the only improvement to the picture that I can see, is that the light reflected too much on the belly of the black widow, making it difficult to have a nice detail of the hourglass shape. Very good job 7-morterin</td>', 'I hope you killed this after taking the picture!!!, the only improvement to the picture that I can see, is that the light reflected too much on the belly of the black widow, making it difficult to have a nice detail of the hourglass shape. Very good job 7-morterin', '2002-11-17 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153088, 8012, 3317, '<td valign="top">is that a black widow? bonus points for risking your life in pursuit of a shot. you get a ten.</td>', 'is that a black widow? bonus points for risking your life in pursuit of a shot. you get a ten.', '2002-11-17 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153089, 8012, 806, '<td valign="top">oooh! the notorious black widow spider! excellent crisp photo.. love how the web is also well defined, and yet the backdrop is appropriately out of the focus plane. They are dangerous, so I''m sure you didn''t want to play around to close, but too bad you didn''t have a white card or something to place behind the spider to clean up the background. I am giving this a high score, but that last comment is only "wonder".... :0)<br/></td>', 'oooh! the notorious black widow spider! excellent crisp photo.. love how the web is also well defined, and yet the backdrop is appropriately out of the focus plane. They are dangerous, so I''m sure you didn''t want to play around to close, but too bad you didn''t have a white card or something to place behind the spider to clean up the background. I am giving this a high score, but that last comment is only "wonder".... :0)', '2002-11-17 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153090, 8012, 4162, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I thought it was plastic, just too amazingly scary to believe it is real!  Never seen a picture of a black widow before. Its an amazing shot!  Congrats to you! Natasha</td>', 'Sorry, I thought it was plastic, just too amazingly scary to believe it is real!  Never seen a picture of a black widow before. Its an amazing shot!  Congrats to you! Natasha', '2002-11-18 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(153091, 8012, 3454, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. It was not behind glass or anything, which made it a challenge to shoot - these things can run fast! The camera was only inches away.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. It was not behind glass or anything, which made it a challenge to shoot - these things can run fast! The camera was only inches away.', '2002-11-20 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(153092, 8013, 5047, '<td valign="top">sick.</td>', 'sick.', '2002-11-11 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153093, 8013, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very appealing. I like the shape around the sun. Strange how the camera catches these things sometimes.</td>', 'Very appealing. I like the shape around the sun. Strange how the camera catches these things sometimes.', '2002-11-11 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153094, 8013, 674, '<td valign="top">Composition: original but too much flaredetracts from close up 4 <br/>Lighting:  4,<br/> Appeal: 4, Total Rating 4 Sulamk<br/></td>', 'Composition: original but too much flaredetracts from close up 4 Lighting:  4, Appeal: 4, Total Rating 4 Sulamk', '2002-11-11 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
