(153143, 8018, 2700, '<td valign="top">6. Too bad you couldnt get the whole face into thi shot. I took the picture of the IS300 guages which I had a similar problem (fitting a circle into a rectangle), what I chose to do was zoom in so that the framing was closer... IN this instance  possible only the top 1/2 of the watch...</td>', '6. Too bad you couldnt get the whole face into thi shot. I took the picture of the IS300 guages which I had a similar problem (fitting a circle into a rectangle), what I chose to do was zoom in so that the framing was closer... IN this instance  possible only the top 1/2 of the watch...', '2002-11-12 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153144, 8018, 2200, '<td valign="top">very sharp image. good detail</td>', 'very sharp image. good detail', '2002-11-12 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153145, 8018, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2002-11-12 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153146, 8018, 3479, '<td valign="top">more distinct shadows and a slightly different crop would have made great.</td>', 'more distinct shadows and a slightly different crop would have made great.', '2002-11-12 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153147, 8018, 2460, '<td valign="top">Great detail</td>', 'Great detail', '2002-11-12 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153148, 8018, 4267, '<td valign="top">very crisp and clear...</td>', 'very crisp and clear...', '2002-11-12 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153149, 8018, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is so clear.  A little to one side but very crisp and clear.  Beautiful colors in the watch.  Shame about the shadow on the left as you look at it.  Still a 6.  PTL</td>', 'This is so clear.  A little to one side but very crisp and clear.  Beautiful colors in the watch.  Shame about the shadow on the left as you look at it.  Still a 6.  PTL', '2002-11-12 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
