(153158, 8019, 4100, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, but I don''t think your camera had the macro/close-up "oomph" to pull off this shot, particularly to display at this resolution. It''s difficult to even see the ants against the busy background. You''ve clearly got an eye for a photo opportunity, though.</td>', 'This was a good idea, but I don''t think your camera had the macro/close-up "oomph" to pull off this shot, particularly to display at this resolution. It''s difficult to even see the ants against the busy background. You''ve clearly got an eye for a photo opportunity, though.', '2002-11-11 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
