(153160, 8019, 4493, '<td valign="top">Lowering the camera to get some height from the hill as well as your light being lower might have helped. If this is as close as your camera gets, I understand, but I see no ants either.</td>', 'Lowering the camera to get some height from the hill as well as your light being lower might have helped. If this is as close as your camera gets, I understand, but I see no ants either.', '2002-11-11 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
