(153164, 8019, 4361, '<td valign="top">its okay, not all that i guess, u can hardly see the ants, or the hill u can barely spot the whole, and i cant even see the aint hill.</td>', 'its okay, not all that i guess, u can hardly see the ants, or the hill u can barely spot the whole, and i cant even see the aint hill.', '2002-11-12 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153165, 8019, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- kind of met, i don''t get the feeling that you are close up from the photo.  this is not really an anthill, more like fine gravel around a crack in the road where ants live.<br/>technical -- good.<br/>composition -- there''s really nothing very interesting in this photo, sorry.  ants would make a huge difference.  overall, maybe if the hole was a little less off-center could add some dynamics to the photo.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- kind of met, i don''t get the feeling that you are close up from the photo.  this is not really an anthill, more like fine gravel around a crack in the road where ants live.technical -- good.composition -- there''s really nothing very interesting in this photo, sorry.  ants would make a huge difference.  overall, maybe if the hole was a little less off-center could add some dynamics to the photo.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153166, 8019, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a decent closeup, but i''m not drawn to the image subjectively... - setzler</td>', 'This is a decent closeup, but i''m not drawn to the image subjectively... - setzler', '2002-11-12 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
