(153168, 8019, 3540, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look terribly populated.  I would have put the hole off center to find a few more ants for this pic.  The composition is very boring with only a couple. - Just my opinion - Inspzil</td>', 'Doesn''t look terribly populated.  I would have put the hole off center to find a few more ants for this pic.  The composition is very boring with only a couple. - Just my opinion - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 05:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
