(153170, 8019, 2984, '<td valign="top">An ant would have been nice</td>', 'An ant would have been nice', '2002-11-13 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153171, 8019, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know it''s an ant hill but I''m having trouble finding the ants.  I recently took a shot of a fire ant hill covered with ants and none of the ants showed up in the photo.  I can''t figure it out.  If you get it I''d like to know how.  The ant hill is what you titled it and it is a good ant hill.  I''ll give you 7 for that but would have liked to have had the ants to confirm the "ant" part of the hill.  PTL</td>', 'I know it''s an ant hill but I''m having trouble finding the ants.  I recently took a shot of a fire ant hill covered with ants and none of the ants showed up in the photo.  I can''t figure it out.  If you get it I''d like to know how.  The ant hill is what you titled it and it is a good ant hill.  I''ll give you 7 for that but would have liked to have had the ants to confirm the "ant" part of the hill.  PTL', '2002-11-14 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153172, 8019, 1005, '<td valign="top">It seems to missing something, maybe ants?  6 Swash</td>', 'It seems to missing something, maybe ants?  6 Swash', '2002-11-14 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153173, 8019, 5034, '<td valign="top">Well thanks for your feedback folks, this is my first entry and i havent been doing photography long.  My best shot was of a racing car crash 3 or 4 years ago and that was by pure luck.  I have taken your comments onboard and will try to do better in future.  The ants are there they are just really small, like most ants here in Perth, the capital of Western Australia.</td>', 'Well thanks for your feedback folks, this is my first entry and i havent been doing photography long.  My best shot was of a racing car crash 3 or 4 years ago and that was by pure luck.  I have taken your comments onboard and will try to do better in future.  The ants are there they are just really small, like most ants here in Perth, the capital of Western Australia.', '2002-11-18 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(153174, 8020, 4049, '<td valign="top">eww</td>', 'eww', '2002-11-11 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153175, 8020, 1041, '<td valign="top">ugh, sorry, but this looks gross.  but maybe that''s what you were going for.<br/>challenge -- met i guess, even though i see nothing that provides me with a sense of scale.<br/>technical -- the picture looks a little fuzzy and you have lots of reflections that are a little distracting.<br/>composition -- two things fighting for attention the most are the red veins at the bottom and the shiny thing at the top.  overall, i think you are missing an area of focus.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'ugh, sorry, but this looks gross.  but maybe that''s what you were going for.challenge -- met i guess, even though i see nothing that provides me with a sense of scale.technical -- the picture looks a little fuzzy and you have lots of reflections that are a little distracting.composition -- two things fighting for attention the most are the red veins at the bottom and the shiny thing at the top.  overall, i think you are missing an area of focus.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
