(153184, 8020, 173, '<td valign="top">Yummy!</td>', 'Yummy!', '2002-11-13 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153185, 8020, 3080, '<td valign="top">Ew.  Definately an unknown species to me.  Looks almost more like a clam than a mushroom.  A good angle and the framing/cropping is nice. I like how the entire subject fills the frame.  The lighting seems to be giving is a blue tint, unless of course it is that way naturally.  I think you did a good job avoiding harsh shadows.  An interesting shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Ew.  Definately an unknown species to me.  Looks almost more like a clam than a mushroom.  A good angle and the framing/cropping is nice. I like how the entire subject fills the frame.  The lighting seems to be giving is a blue tint, unless of course it is that way naturally.  I think you did a good job avoiding harsh shadows.  An interesting shot. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-13 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153186, 8020, 741, '<td valign="top">Did you leave the mushroom in it''s cellophane packet?  If it hadn''t then this could have been really good.  I like the way it resembles a brain but the shiny highlights and blurry bits just make it look a mess.</td>', 'Did you leave the mushroom in it''s cellophane packet?  If it hadn''t then this could have been really good.  I like the way it resembles a brain but the shiny highlights and blurry bits just make it look a mess.', '2002-11-13 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
