(153196, 8021, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great capture of the bug with it''s wings open, I only wish it were in sharper focus.  The sharpest focus seems to be the B, as the G looks a bit blurred.  The bugs wings are blurred, I assume from motion, but that''s not a huge deal.  Lighting is ok.  Gets a bit bright to the upper right corner, but still a rare capture.  nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Wow.  Great capture of the bug with it''s wings open, I only wish it were in sharper focus.  The sharpest focus seems to be the B, as the G looks a bit blurred.  The bugs wings are blurred, I assume from motion, but that''s not a huge deal.  Lighting is ok.  Gets a bit bright to the upper right corner, but still a rare capture.  nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153197, 8021, 4210, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this was a wonderful stroke of luck, or if you somehow set it up like this. Either way--marvy!</td>', 'I wonder if this was a wonderful stroke of luck, or if you somehow set it up like this. Either way--marvy!', '2002-11-11 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
