(153204, 8021, 4648, '<td valign="top">ONLY THING WRONG - you should have cropped out the whole right side as I look at it.  The wing covers lifted with the wings stopped in action - these are things you just don''t get except.... once in a life time..  Even the "V", "G".  and "B" are in great focus.  You should have come in on the bug.  Wouldn''t stay in focus?   It''s still a good solid 8.  PTL</td>', 'ONLY THING WRONG - you should have cropped out the whole right side as I look at it.  The wing covers lifted with the wings stopped in action - these are things you just don''t get except.... once in a life time..  Even the "V", "G".  and "B" are in great focus.  You should have come in on the bug.  Wouldn''t stay in focus?   It''s still a good solid 8.  PTL', '2002-11-12 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
