(153251, 8027, 1041, '<td valign="top">love your title!  :)<br/>challenge -- met.<br/>technical -- i would like to see more DOF.  you''ve used it well, but maybe if you''d been more parallel to the metal, you could''ve gotten some more in focus w/out loosing the diagonal-on view.  but, maybe you tried, and didn''t like it.  this is just my 2cents.  i would''ve also removed the cobwebs first. :)<br/>composition -- nice to view this at an angle.  did you try cropping just a tad tighter on the left and bottom so that the wall isn''t visible below the metal?<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'love your title!  :)challenge -- met.technical -- i would like to see more DOF.  you''ve used it well, but maybe if you''d been more parallel to the metal, you could''ve gotten some more in focus w/out loosing the diagonal-on view.  but, maybe you tried, and didn''t like it.  this is just my 2cents.  i would''ve also removed the cobwebs first. :)composition -- nice to view this at an angle.  did you try cropping just a tad tighter on the left and bottom so that the wall isn''t visible below the metal?-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-11 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
