(153326, 8037, 4267, '<td valign="top">I think I would like it better if the central petals were the petals in focus... but the lighting is great!</td>', 'I think I would like it better if the central petals were the petals in focus... but the lighting is great!', '2002-11-12 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153327, 8037, 3454, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and subtle colour.</td>', 'Nice lighting and subtle colour.', '2002-11-13 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153328, 8037, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great metal rose.  Almost looks real.  Would have prefered you not crop the edges off.  Would like to have seen it all.  Soft focus is good on this.  In my opinion the only thing that hurt it is the crop.  That cropped off 2 points for an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Great metal rose.  Almost looks real.  Would have prefered you not crop the edges off.  Would like to have seen it all.  Soft focus is good on this.  In my opinion the only thing that hurt it is the crop.  That cropped off 2 points for an 8.  PTL', '2002-11-16 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153329, 8038, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  The background works perfectly with the in focus subject.  Strange color chalk! Ours is blue. :)  Your focus is nice.  Angle and framing/cropping are perfect in my opinion.  Lighting is great.  Very nice. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  The background works perfectly with the in focus subject.  Strange color chalk! Ours is blue. :)  Your focus is nice.  Angle and framing/cropping are perfect in my opinion.  Lighting is great.  Very nice. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
