(153337, 8038, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very good. Original subject, nice composition, good light.<br/>Wonder what a green table would add or is it better this way?<br/>Anyway, very good shot.</td>', 'Very good. Original subject, nice composition, good light.Wonder what a green table would add or is it better this way?Anyway, very good shot.', '2002-11-12 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153338, 8038, 3936, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  8 ball in the background really makes this photo.  If I would have done anything different, it would have been to remove the the out of focus object to the left of the 8 ball, and change the background a bit.  Something is needed there to give the 8 ball its shape, but the red is a tiny bit distracting.  Key word is tiny, because this is really a nice photo and it would make a great poster in a billiard parlor or game room of a home.  Congratulations on a really good photo.</td>', 'Great composition.  8 ball in the background really makes this photo.  If I would have done anything different, it would have been to remove the the out of focus object to the left of the 8 ball, and change the background a bit.  Something is needed there to give the 8 ball its shape, but the red is a tiny bit distracting.  Key word is tiny, because this is really a nice photo and it would make a great poster in a billiard parlor or game room of a home.  Congratulations on a really good photo.', '2002-11-13 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
