(153516, 8049, 3575, '<td valign="top">Yes! Now that''s the way I like to see my Lycopersicon Esculentum!</td>', 'Yes! Now that''s the way I like to see my Lycopersicon Esculentum!', '2002-11-12 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153517, 8049, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job!  This is one of three I gave a 10 to.  Congrats!  Hope the photo does well!<br/><br/>-Talya</td>', 'Beautiful job!  This is one of three I gave a 10 to.  Congrats!  Hope the photo does well!-Talya', '2002-11-12 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153518, 8049, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light reflects off the bottom left water drop.  Could be just me, but the tomato doesn''t seem to be in focus.  I realize that a tomato really doesn''t have much texture, but if it weren''t for the stems showing, it would seem to be just a picture of a red blob.  Maybe pulling back a little from the subject would get it in better focus AND then cropping would make it better.  The water drop is the cool part for me :-)  6</td>', 'I like the way the light reflects off the bottom left water drop.  Could be just me, but the tomato doesn''t seem to be in focus.  I realize that a tomato really doesn''t have much texture, but if it weren''t for the stems showing, it would seem to be just a picture of a red blob.  Maybe pulling back a little from the subject would get it in better focus AND then cropping would make it better.  The water drop is the cool part for me :-)  6', '2002-11-12 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153519, 8049, 133, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed!</td>', 'Nicely photographed!', '2002-11-13 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
