(153542, 8052, 4411, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, I just feel the composition could be a bit better (though I hate to think how you could get the little critter to pose properly!). I would possibly have cropped 1/4 off the top &amp; left hand sides on this shot.<br/>I have a feeling this will do well though - good luck.</td>', 'Not a bad photo, I just feel the composition could be a bit better (though I hate to think how you could get the little critter to pose properly!). I would possibly have cropped 1/4 off the top & left hand sides on this shot.I have a feeling this will do well though - good luck.', '2002-11-11 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
