(153727, 8072, 4648, '<td valign="top">What is this foot?  I''ve seen it before but can''t remember what it is attached too.  Photo makes me want to see the creature.  This time that is good.  Draws me back.  Technically a good photo with just a couple of things.  Too much contrast in the lighting for me.  Cut it down in the front and give me a little more in the back.  All in all good shot.  7 will do it right.  PTL</td>', 'What is this foot?  I''ve seen it before but can''t remember what it is attached too.  Photo makes me want to see the creature.  This time that is good.  Draws me back.  Technically a good photo with just a couple of things.  Too much contrast in the lighting for me.  Cut it down in the front and give me a little more in the back.  All in all good shot.  7 will do it right.  PTL', '2002-11-14 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153728, 8072, 3317, '<td valign="top">that''s really scary. nine.</td>', 'that''s really scary. nine.', '2002-11-16 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
