(153739, 8073, 3540, '<td valign="top">First off, I think the shot should''ve been taken much closer.  I would''ve made just some of the rustier part of this the subject, leaving it a sort of mysterious abstract. - Inspzil</td>', 'First off, I think the shot should''ve been taken much closer.  I would''ve made just some of the rustier part of this the subject, leaving it a sort of mysterious abstract. - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153740, 8073, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot.  I only wish there was a bit less DOF so that the leaf on the right would blend into the background more.  DPz</td>', 'I like this shot alot.  I only wish there was a bit less DOF so that the leaf on the right would blend into the background more.  DPz', '2002-11-13 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153741, 8073, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nostalgia will do it every time.  Great choice and composition.  Like the touch of the leaf in the top corner.  Maybe that was an accident, I don''t know.  But it adds for me.  The rust add also.  Know how old this is?  Don''t tell me less than 10 year.  I''ll be heartbroken.  It is a solid 8.  PTL.</td>', 'Nostalgia will do it every time.  Great choice and composition.  Like the touch of the leaf in the top corner.  Maybe that was an accident, I don''t know.  But it adds for me.  The rust add also.  Know how old this is?  Don''t tell me less than 10 year.  I''ll be heartbroken.  It is a solid 8.  PTL.', '2002-11-16 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153742, 8074, 4986, '<td valign="top">What?</td>', 'What?', '2002-11-11 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153743, 8074, 4210, '<td valign="top">Guh! -shudders- Creepy bugs! lol. The focus could be sharper and the lighting better, but I understand how hard it must be to work with unco-operative crawling things.</td>', 'Guh! -shudders- Creepy bugs! lol. The focus could be sharper and the lighting better, but I understand how hard it must be to work with unco-operative crawling things.', '2002-11-11 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153744, 8074, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is a nice close up, but too dark.  Perhaps you could brighten it in an editing program to make that bug really pop out.</td>', 'This is a nice close up, but too dark.  Perhaps you could brighten it in an editing program to make that bug really pop out.', '2002-11-11 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153745, 8074, 4998, '<td valign="top">haha, yeh this is defenetly something i can relate to. i gave it a 7. the lighting needed some work, but I guess by the time u turned on the light it might''ve left. so good work still.</td>', 'haha, yeh this is defenetly something i can relate to. i gave it a 7. the lighting needed some work, but I guess by the time u turned on the light it might''ve left. so good work still.', '2002-11-11 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153746, 8074, 2460, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it was hard just to get this photo, because I''m sure he was real tiny, however, I don''t think there is enough detail.  Could just be the colors of the little guy, or rather lack thereof.</td>', 'I''m sure it was hard just to get this photo, because I''m sure he was real tiny, however, I don''t think there is enough detail.  Could just be the colors of the little guy, or rather lack thereof.', '2002-11-11 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
