(153751, 8074, 4648, '<td valign="top">A little more light would have helped.......but then you might not have gotten the picture then.  Still pretty good.  You can see the bands on the legs and can actually tell the front from the back.  A tad too grainy, but not enough to take you out of the 6 category.  A little more light and it would have been a solid 8. PTL.</td>', 'A little more light would have helped.......but then you might not have gotten the picture then.  Still pretty good.  You can see the bands on the legs and can actually tell the front from the back.  A tad too grainy, but not enough to take you out of the 6 category.  A little more light and it would have been a solid 8. PTL.', '2002-11-12 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153752, 8074, 1031, '<td valign="top">I trust your picture info says what this is -- it''s unfamiliar to me. I''d have tried for more contrast because I''m interested in the details, but I realize it might not "look as good" that way.</td>', 'I trust your picture info says what this is -- it''s unfamiliar to me. I''d have tried for more contrast because I''m interested in the details, but I realize it might not "look as good" that way.', '2002-11-15 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
