(153754, 8074, 5121, '<td valign="top">If i''d have seen something like this in the room I reckon I probably have reached for the camera too (much to my wifes annoyance!).  Hope you still managed to get rid of it!</td>', 'If i''d have seen something like this in the room I reckon I probably have reached for the camera too (much to my wifes annoyance!).  Hope you still managed to get rid of it!', '2002-11-17 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153755, 8074, 4617, '<td valign="top">what kind of insect is that? and i don''t think i''d like to have an encounter with it. good detail - vw4lyfe</td>', 'what kind of insect is that? and i don''t think i''d like to have an encounter with it. good detail - vw4lyfe', '2002-11-17 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153756, 8076, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit muted.  Maybe brightened a tad too much?  Overall though, the angle and framing/cropping are nice, and the focus seems good.  Definately a close up.  Maybe would have liked to see it toned down just a bit. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The colors seem a bit muted.  Maybe brightened a tad too much?  Overall though, the angle and framing/cropping are nice, and the focus seems good.  Definately a close up.  Maybe would have liked to see it toned down just a bit. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153757, 8076, 3540, '<td valign="top">Something is not right with this photo, and it might be on purpose that way.  The color of the needle looks like the color of bare steel.  It looks like it''s been oversharpened and is quite grainy.  Unfortunate really, it was a great idea. - Inspzil</td>', 'Something is not right with this photo, and it might be on purpose that way.  The color of the needle looks like the color of bare steel.  It looks like it''s been oversharpened and is quite grainy.  Unfortunate really, it was a great idea. - Inspzil', '2002-11-11 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153758, 8076, 3273, '<td valign="top">Looks too bright.  I guess that you increased the brightness in order to make the background as white as possible but I feel that this has affected the subject too much.</td>', 'Looks too bright.  I guess that you increased the brightness in order to make the background as white as possible but I feel that this has affected the subject too much.', '2002-11-11 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153759, 8076, 4514, '<td valign="top">What is the reason for being able to see the pixels around the perimeter of the needle?</td>', 'What is the reason for being able to see the pixels around the perimeter of the needle?', '2002-11-11 07:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
