(153761, 8076, 4472, '<td valign="top">Eityher overexposed or over brightened, nasty fringing on the corron reel.  Could have had a better crop, there is too much white space to the left and top of the frame</td>', 'Eityher overexposed or over brightened, nasty fringing on the corron reel.  Could have had a better crop, there is too much white space to the left and top of the frame', '2002-11-11 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
