(153834, 8085, 3981, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  It''s a winner.  The only thing keeping me from giving it a 9 is the fact that it took awhile for me to figure out the toothpaste running together.  In my humble opinion, there should have been the same degree of separateness in the paste as in the toothbrushes.  Nevertheless, a great shot.  8.  Bitz</td>', 'Love this shot!  It''s a winner.  The only thing keeping me from giving it a 9 is the fact that it took awhile for me to figure out the toothpaste running together.  In my humble opinion, there should have been the same degree of separateness in the paste as in the toothbrushes.  Nevertheless, a great shot.  8.  Bitz', '2002-11-11 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
