(153841, 8085, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Says a lot.  Sure fits the challenge.  Great idea.  Love the texture of the lips.  Don''t think you could have made it any better.  Just seems strange giving a 9 to this.  It probable deserves a 10 photo wise.  Maybe before the voting is over I''ll come back.  For right not 9 is it.  Maybe I''ll see the wow by then.  PTL</td>', 'Cute.  Says a lot.  Sure fits the challenge.  Great idea.  Love the texture of the lips.  Don''t think you could have made it any better.  Just seems strange giving a 9 to this.  It probable deserves a 10 photo wise.  Maybe before the voting is over I''ll come back.  For right not 9 is it.  Maybe I''ll see the wow by then.  PTL', '2002-11-14 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
