(153849, 8085, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear. The symmetry is impressive. Wonderful photo. Lnede</td>', 'Very crisp and clear. The symmetry is impressive. Wonderful photo. Lnede', '2002-11-17 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153850, 8085, 3942, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for your comments on this shot.  I think, that I don''t have to tell you more about the setup, there is nothing special about it. But I''ll try to answer on some of your comments:<br/><br/>- Why not horizontal? <br/>I tried that too, but it didn''t look very impressive to me... <br/><br/>- Why I didn''t centered the toothbrushes with the lips? <br/>You my be sure, that I tried that. But it is not very easy in the macro modus. The model has to stay absolutely motionless and a divergency of 2mm (it''s not much more in this shot) is nerly  unobservable due to the shooting ''stress''. I made about 20 shots with different expressions of the lips and finally I liked this one most. But unfortunately there are these 2mm distance from '' perfection'' ;-) <br/><br/>- Why 2 toothbrushes and why is the toothpaste running together? <br/>Well, I can''t remember where I saw that before. Maybe it was a german advertising spot. She is waiting for him in the bathroom and has prepared already everything for the united teeth brushing. I thought, that I can transform this story with the kiss in the background into a macro shot. Doesn''t everyone want to start into a day with a view like that :-)?</td>', 'Thanks a lot for your comments on this shot.  I think, that I don''t have to tell you more about the setup, there is nothing special about it. But I''ll try to answer on some of your comments:- Why not horizontal? I tried that too, but it didn''t look very impressive to me... - Why I didn''t centered the toothbrushes with the lips? You my be sure, that I tried that. But it is not very easy in the macro modus. The model has to stay absolutely motionless and a divergency of 2mm (it''s not much more in this shot) is nerly  unobservable due to the shooting ''stress''. I made about 20 shots with different expressions of the lips and finally I liked this one most. But unfortunately there are these 2mm distance from '' perfection'' ;-) - Why 2 toothbrushes and why is the toothpaste running together? Well, I can''t remember where I saw that before. Maybe it was a german advertising spot. She is waiting for him in the bathroom and has prepared already everything for the united teeth brushing. I thought, that I can transform this story with the kiss in the background into a macro shot. Doesn''t everyone want to start into a day with a view like that :-)?', '2002-11-18 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
