(153868, 8086, 3946, '<td valign="top">Nice snail pic.  Knowing that he was probably climbing, I can''t decide if it would have been better the other way.  I don''t know.  Either way, it is well focused, good detail and clean.</td>', 'Nice snail pic.  Knowing that he was probably climbing, I can''t decide if it would have been better the other way.  I don''t know.  Either way, it is well focused, good detail and clean.', '2002-11-13 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153869, 8086, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Excellent detail and clarity.  I really like the lighting on the shell - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice shot.  Excellent detail and clarity.  I really like the lighting on the shell - Inspzil', '2002-11-14 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
