(153873, 8086, 1827, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture.  The tones are great.  The texture on the snail''s body is amazing.  I love it.  In my top ten for the week.  9, just-married</td>', 'Terrific capture.  The tones are great.  The texture on the snail''s body is amazing.  I love it.  In my top ten for the week.  9, just-married', '2002-11-17 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
