(153930, 8094, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty picture, sort of an artsy abstract.  I''m not so sure I like it for this challenge though - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a pretty picture, sort of an artsy abstract.  I''m not so sure I like it for this challenge though - Inspzil', '2002-11-15 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153931, 8094, 3317, '<td valign="top">running water is the neatest. gotta have something else in the frame though, so we can understand what it''s running around/over.</td>', 'running water is the neatest. gotta have something else in the frame though, so we can understand what it''s running around/over.', '2002-11-16 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153932, 8094, 4648, '<td valign="top">What is this.  I hope you tell us in the end.  Maybe a part of a mountain stream?  It''s intriguing, that''s for sure.  Technically don''t see a lot wrong just wish I knew what it was.  right now it''s a 7.  What are the white dots surrounded by pink?  I gotta know about this one.  PTL</td>', 'What is this.  I hope you tell us in the end.  Maybe a part of a mountain stream?  It''s intriguing, that''s for sure.  Technically don''t see a lot wrong just wish I knew what it was.  right now it''s a 7.  What are the white dots surrounded by pink?  I gotta know about this one.  PTL', '2002-11-16 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153933, 8094, 2706, '<td valign="top">woh... what is that!</td>', 'woh... what is that!', '2002-11-16 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153934, 8094, 5036, '<td valign="top">This is a picture of a small mountain stream. It''s flowing over rocks with fallen leaves on top ( the brown in the pic).  It was taken so close as to fit the catagory, that is why there isn''t much surrounding the subject. the white dots w/ pink is probaly just sunlight beaming down from behind me. Thanks for all the comments.</td>', 'This is a picture of a small mountain stream. It''s flowing over rocks with fallen leaves on top ( the brown in the pic).  It was taken so close as to fit the catagory, that is why there isn''t much surrounding the subject. the white dots w/ pink is probaly just sunlight beaming down from behind me. Thanks for all the comments.', '2002-11-18 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(153935, 8096, 2344, '<td valign="top">And what is it we''re seeing through this microscope?</td>', 'And what is it we''re seeing through this microscope?', '2002-11-11 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153936, 8096, 5064, '<td valign="top">What are we looking at, exactly?</td>', 'What are we looking at, exactly?', '2002-11-11 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153937, 8096, 3859, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but if I knew what I was seeing, it would have more impact.</td>', 'Interesting, but if I knew what I was seeing, it would have more impact.', '2002-11-11 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153938, 8096, 714, '<td valign="top">Good macro, but it helps if I know what I am looking at.  3 Sonifo</td>', 'Good macro, but it helps if I know what I am looking at.  3 Sonifo', '2002-11-11 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153939, 8096, 4267, '<td valign="top">wondering what this is.. lol</td>', 'wondering what this is.. lol', '2002-11-11 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(153940, 8096, 63, '<td valign="top">Can you still call it "macro" or is it "micro" photography?  7 - jimsapp</td>', 'Can you still call it "macro" or is it "micro" photography?  7 - jimsapp', '2002-11-11 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
