(153942, 8096, 4266, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure I don''t want to know what this is.  That said, I also scored it low because there is no focus whatsoever.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure I don''t want to know what this is.  That said, I also scored it low because there is no focus whatsoever.', '2002-11-15 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
