(154012, 8104, 881, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments!  I actually know how to solve a Rubik''s Cube, and every once in a while, I blow the dust of my Cube to make sure I don''t forget.  The worn edges are from repeated playing, not from any "manipulation" such as peeling stickers or popping cubes (though I certainly had friends who had done so to *their* cubes =P ).</td>', 'Thanks for the comments!  I actually know how to solve a Rubik''s Cube, and every once in a while, I blow the dust of my Cube to make sure I don''t forget.  The worn edges are from repeated playing, not from any "manipulation" such as peeling stickers or popping cubes (though I certainly had friends who had done so to *their* cubes =P ).', '2002-11-19 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
