(154074, 8107, 2244, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments and votes!  Top 3 is fantastic!  By no means did I expect this....as a matter of fact, I was planning to pull the picture but didn''t get around to doing it in time....so much for knowing what people think!  I thought I was going to get a 5ish and was thinking about submitting it with a slightly different (more dynamic composition) in hope of doing better.  What can I say; very happy with the result: now I have a ribbon rainbow with 1,2,3!!</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments and votes!  Top 3 is fantastic!  By no means did I expect this....as a matter of fact, I was planning to pull the picture but didn''t get around to doing it in time....so much for knowing what people think!  I thought I was going to get a 5ish and was thinking about submitting it with a slightly different (more dynamic composition) in hope of doing better.  What can I say; very happy with the result: now I have a ribbon rainbow with 1,2,3!!', '2002-11-18 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(154075, 8108, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love this, as I collect coins also.  Yours are in real good condition as far as wear goes.  Photo is real good.  Not too bright, no shadows and I like the gold one offset against Eisenhour.  Great job. Great 8. PTL</td>', 'Love this, as I collect coins also.  Yours are in real good condition as far as wear goes.  Photo is real good.  Not too bright, no shadows and I like the gold one offset against Eisenhour.  Great job. Great 8. PTL', '2002-11-12 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154076, 8109, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Great focus.  The detail in the middle of this flower is great.  Love the colors.  The blue background works perfectly to bring out the yellow of the petals.  I wouldn''t want the lighting in the bottom left to be any brighter, but ok as it is.  The angle and framing/cropping are good in my opinion.  I like how you have filled the photo with the subject.  Nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Very pretty.  Great focus.  The detail in the middle of this flower is great.  Love the colors.  The blue background works perfectly to bring out the yellow of the petals.  I wouldn''t want the lighting in the bottom left to be any brighter, but ok as it is.  The angle and framing/cropping are good in my opinion.  I like how you have filled the photo with the subject.  Nice job. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154077, 8109, 4514, '<td valign="top">Great Shot</td>', 'Great Shot', '2002-11-11 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
