(154088, 8109, 806, '<td valign="top">tangible! pops off the screen.. feels 3D!  Compositionally, the decision to place the center so far to the right of the frame bothers me. colors are soo vibrant. appealing, interesting, and emotive. nice work!</td>', 'tangible! pops off the screen.. feels 3D!  Compositionally, the decision to place the center so far to the right of the frame bothers me. colors are soo vibrant. appealing, interesting, and emotive. nice work!', '2002-11-12 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154089, 8109, 3575, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. Som might feel that the petals need ot be in focus but it is obvious that your focus is the center of the flower - stamen - pistel -- whatever it''s called and it''s wonderful. The saturation of colors is very good and I like the bit of blue background. - 10 joanns</td>', 'This is excellent. Som might feel that the petals need ot be in focus but it is obvious that your focus is the center of the flower - stamen - pistel -- whatever it''s called and it''s wonderful. The saturation of colors is very good and I like the bit of blue background. - 10 joanns', '2002-11-12 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
