(154091, 8109, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail!  I think the composition here is great as well... the lighting may be a tad strong though... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent detail!  I think the composition here is great as well... the lighting may be a tad strong though... good work :) - setzler', '2002-11-13 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
