(154127, 8115, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool pic.  Lots of nice color, always a bonus.  I think the framing could be changed some to benefit this shot.  Maybe moving it down just a little would help bring back some of the lines lost in the crop.  Nice image - Inspzil</td>', 'Cool pic.  Lots of nice color, always a bonus.  I think the framing could be changed some to benefit this shot.  Maybe moving it down just a little would help bring back some of the lines lost in the crop.  Nice image - Inspzil', '2002-11-14 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
