(154228, 8118, 3317, '<td valign="top">whoah, that''s pretty. eight for you.</td>', 'whoah, that''s pretty. eight for you.', '2002-11-16 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154229, 8118, 5241, '<td valign="top">Little fellow has  a very direct gaze!</td>', 'Little fellow has  a very direct gaze!', '2002-11-17 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154230, 8121, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Not your usual flower picture!  Good focus.  I can even see spider webs!</td>', 'Very nice.  Not your usual flower picture!  Good focus.  I can even see spider webs!', '2002-11-11 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154231, 8121, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Bg is a bit distracting here.</td>', 'Nice job. Bg is a bit distracting here.', '2002-11-11 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154232, 8121, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great focus job.  Jacko.</td>', 'Great focus job.  Jacko.', '2002-11-11 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154233, 8121, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice composition and color.<br/>think you could crop an inch or two off the bottom.</td>', 'nice composition and color.think you could crop an inch or two off the bottom.', '2002-11-11 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154234, 8121, 5023, '<td valign="top">nice shot but very easy</td>', 'nice shot but very easy', '2002-11-11 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154235, 8121, 4829, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, great quality and clarity! I like the way that the background turned out.</td>', 'Interesting subject, great quality and clarity! I like the way that the background turned out.', '2002-11-12 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154236, 8121, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  DPz</td>', 'Very nice composition.  DPz', '2002-11-12 05:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154237, 8121, 3317, '<td valign="top">what makes decaying things so beautiful?</td>', 'what makes decaying things so beautiful?', '2002-11-12 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154238, 8121, 4455, '<td valign="top">I feel so bad for the dried up flower-anz</td>', 'I feel so bad for the dried up flower-anz', '2002-11-12 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154239, 8121, 92, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I would like to see a bit more of the stem.</td>', 'I really like this. I would like to see a bit more of the stem.', '2002-11-15 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154240, 8121, 4617, '<td valign="top">nice closeup great detail. good lighting - vw4lyfe 8</td>', 'nice closeup great detail. good lighting - vw4lyfe 8', '2002-11-17 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154241, 8122, 117, '<td valign="top">did an excellent job on the fly what were are aloud to use--10bobgaither</td>', 'did an excellent job on the fly what were are aloud to use--10bobgaither', '2002-11-11 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154242, 8122, 2148, '<td valign="top">Great shot lovely colours and just the right point of focus. I would have preferred it to be cropped in portrait and to concetrate on the central flower and the fly. It appears that 2/3rds of the frame are wasted:8 -lamedos-</td>', 'Great shot lovely colours and just the right point of focus. I would have preferred it to be cropped in portrait and to concetrate on the central flower and the fly. It appears that 2/3rds of the frame are wasted:8 -lamedos-', '2002-11-11 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154243, 8122, 4510, '<td valign="top">where''s the bug spray 10</td>', 'where''s the bug spray 10', '2002-11-11 07:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154244, 8122, 2937, '<td valign="top">Look in my eyes, Baby :-)<br/>I love the colours and the DOF</td>', 'Look in my eyes, Baby :-)I love the colours and the DOF', '2002-11-11 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154245, 8122, 4297, '<td valign="top">love the focus.</td>', 'love the focus.', '2002-11-11 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154246, 8122, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and DOF ! = 9 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Wonderful color and DOF ! = 9 Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-11 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154247, 8122, 1041, '<td valign="top">isn''t the macro world great?  i love those huge eyes on flies and their shimmering bodies  :)<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- pretty good.  did you use the greatest DOF that your camera allows?  if not, it would be nice to increase it to get the whole flower in focus, too.  but i know that digital cameras have a very shallow DOF in macro mode ...<br/>composition -- did you consider rotating 90CCW?  while your background is blurred nicely, it works even better w/out strong color changes.  just moving around a little sometimes gives a better view.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'isn''t the macro world great?  i love those huge eyes on flies and their shimmering bodies  :)challenge -- mettechnical -- pretty good.  did you use the greatest DOF that your camera allows?  if not, it would be nice to increase it to get the whole flower in focus, too.  but i know that digital cameras have a very shallow DOF in macro mode ...composition -- did you consider rotating 90CCW?  while your background is blurred nicely, it works even better w/out strong color changes.  just moving around a little sometimes gives a better view.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154248, 8122, 2716, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a close-up!  Wish the flower wasn''t so ratty (this time of the year unfortunately).  Great focus on the eye.  Love the shallow depth of field.  Jacko.</td>', 'Now that''s a close-up!  Wish the flower wasn''t so ratty (this time of the year unfortunately).  Great focus on the eye.  Love the shallow depth of field.  Jacko.', '2002-11-11 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154249, 8122, 4829, '<td valign="top">Very colorful!  Great shot as well!</td>', 'Very colorful!  Great shot as well!', '2002-11-12 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154250, 8122, 3859, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very nicely done.  Love the color. Wonderful focus.</td>', 'Wow!  Very nicely done.  Love the color. Wonderful focus.', '2002-11-12 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154251, 8122, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, very close up.  It looks like his eye is dented in.  9 Sonifo</td>', 'Wow, very close up.  It looks like his eye is dented in.  9 Sonifo', '2002-11-12 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154252, 8122, 4648, '<td valign="top">These are the most beautiful flys there are and you sid a superb job of capturing him.  Great contrast of the flower and it''s eyes.  Would have cropped it a little more - I would have.  Forget the third rules.  This would have been a 10 with one flower and fly.  But it is still an 8.  PTL</td>', 'These are the most beautiful flys there are and you sid a superb job of capturing him.  Great contrast of the flower and it''s eyes.  Would have cropped it a little more - I would have.  Forget the third rules.  This would have been a 10 with one flower and fly.  But it is still an 8.  PTL', '2002-11-12 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154253, 8122, 4267, '<td valign="top">very cool and great focus</td>', 'very cool and great focus', '2002-11-12 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154254, 8122, 3454, '<td valign="top">Good work. Only improvements mights be a flat green background (shapes and colours distract the eye), and remove the bud on the left.</td>', 'Good work. Only improvements mights be a flat green background (shapes and colours distract the eye), and remove the bud on the left.', '2002-11-13 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154255, 8122, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh, WOW!!  You picked up really good detail on the fly.  I''m especially impressed by the wings...good job</td>', 'Oh, WOW!!  You picked up really good detail on the fly.  I''m especially impressed by the wings...good job', '2002-11-13 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154256, 8122, 5189, '<td valign="top">nice marco!</td>', 'nice marco!', '2002-11-13 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154257, 8122, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice detail.<br/>thinking maybe a rotation and crop would help the composition.</td>', 'nice detail.thinking maybe a rotation and crop would help the composition.', '2002-11-13 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154258, 8122, 3946, '<td valign="top">Yup another bug photo, but this one is nicely focused.  I like the colors and detail</td>', 'Yup another bug photo, but this one is nicely focused.  I like the colors and detail', '2002-11-14 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154259, 8122, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, composition could have been improved</td>', 'Nice shot, composition could have been improved', '2002-11-14 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154260, 8122, 5070, '<td valign="top">I like many aspects of this shot: contrasting colours, transparency of wings, how the fly''s colours match the background colours. Perfect.</td>', 'I like many aspects of this shot: contrasting colours, transparency of wings, how the fly''s colours match the background colours. Perfect.', '2002-11-14 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154261, 8122, 2553, '<td valign="top">Just an incredible shot.  I am curious as to how you got such "magnification" of the fly.  It is so perfect.  lhall</td>', 'Just an incredible shot.  I am curious as to how you got such "magnification" of the fly.  It is so perfect.  lhall', '2002-11-15 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154262, 8122, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'Good job!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154263, 8122, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wow! Now that''s macro! Great color too. :) Kaz</td>', 'Wow! Now that''s macro! Great color too. :) Kaz', '2002-11-17 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154264, 8122, 4182, '<td valign="top">good image, great color, would have prefered closer if centralised framing like this</td>', 'good image, great color, would have prefered closer if centralised framing like this', '2002-11-17 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154265, 8123, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture, color.</td>', 'Interesting texture, color.', '2002-11-11 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154266, 8123, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but i sorta like the ''abstract'' nature of it... - setzler</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but i sorta like the ''abstract'' nature of it... - setzler', '2002-11-11 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154267, 8123, 4267, '<td valign="top">interesting composition... but I don''t understand.. pens? and from heaven?<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'interesting composition... but I don''t understand.. pens? and from heaven?~anachronite', '2002-11-11 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154268, 8123, 4493, '<td valign="top">Grainularity in the white space as well as what appears to be over photoshopping to touch up the photo make this shot somewhat flat.</td>', 'Grainularity in the white space as well as what appears to be over photoshopping to touch up the photo make this shot somewhat flat.', '2002-11-11 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154269, 8123, 5064, '<td valign="top">Too much of a straight down shot.  More angle needed.</td>', 'Too much of a straight down shot.  More angle needed.', '2002-11-12 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154270, 8123, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract although I can''t figure out what I''m looking at. DPz</td>', 'Nice abstract although I can''t figure out what I''m looking at. DPz', '2002-11-12 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154271, 8123, 3095, '<td valign="top">I looked at it... and looked again...<br/><br/>I like the colours and composition, but you have me stumped as to what this is! You may win my vote for best of... simply for holding my attention for so long!<br/><br/>The subtle grain/posterized effect works well too.</td>', 'I looked at it... and looked again...I like the colours and composition, but you have me stumped as to what this is! You may win my vote for best of... simply for holding my attention for so long!The subtle grain/posterized effect works well too.', '2002-11-12 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154272, 8123, 1280, '<td valign="top">These are pens?  Can''t tell.  Anyway it is a very good composition and I like it.  Good abstract.  Clever title too!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'These are pens?  Can''t tell.  Anyway it is a very good composition and I like it.  Good abstract.  Clever title too!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154273, 8123, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Carsten. 7. James.</td>', 'Nice shot Carsten. 7. James.', '2002-11-17 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154274, 8123, 4998, '<td valign="top">is it allowed to add invertion and sepia affects?</td>', 'is it allowed to add invertion and sepia affects?', '2002-11-18 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(154275, 8124, 4986, '<td valign="top">This could have been done better.  Haven''t we seen enough flowers?</td>', 'This could have been done better.  Haven''t we seen enough flowers?', '2002-11-11 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154276, 8124, 3669, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus really takes away from this picture.  Otherwise, it would have been a very good photo.  I''m assuming that you didn''t have a Macro setting on your camera.  A trick that I learned from this site is to use a magnifying glass in front of your lens to get close-ups to focus better.  Your choice of a yellow background was well suited for the flower.</td>', 'The lack of focus really takes away from this picture.  Otherwise, it would have been a very good photo.  I''m assuming that you didn''t have a Macro setting on your camera.  A trick that I learned from this site is to use a magnifying glass in front of your lens to get close-ups to focus better.  Your choice of a yellow background was well suited for the flower.', '2002-11-11 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154277, 8124, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus is just a tad soft for my personal taste, however, I think that the lighting and color is great.  The angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  A great background for the flower, matches well with the center.  Quite pretty. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'Focus is just a tad soft for my personal taste, however, I think that the lighting and color is great.  The angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  A great background for the flower, matches well with the center.  Quite pretty. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154278, 8124, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too bad out of focus<br/></td>', 'Too bad out of focus', '2002-11-11 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154279, 8124, 3273, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus.  Maybe you were to close??</td>', 'Seems out of focus.  Maybe you were to close??', '2002-11-11 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154280, 8124, 3032, '<td valign="top">Horribly soft</td>', 'Horribly soft', '2002-11-11 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154281, 8124, 4472, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus, and a yellow flower head on a yellow background waqsn''t such aq good idea</td>', 'Very out of focus, and a yellow flower head on a yellow background waqsn''t such aq good idea', '2002-11-11 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154282, 8124, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very pretty but the focus is too soft.</td>', 'Very pretty but the focus is too soft.', '2002-11-11 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154283, 8124, 2123, '<td valign="top">That''s kind of a sad looking daisy. :-)  I''m not sure if I like the monochromaticness of this shot or not.  I think it seems a little faded and dull. 4 kathleenm</td>', 'That''s kind of a sad looking daisy. :-)  I''m not sure if I like the monochromaticness of this shot or not.  I think it seems a little faded and dull. 4 kathleenm', '2002-11-11 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154284, 8124, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but the picture seems out of focus.  Vote 4  Sonifo</td>', 'Nice subject, but the picture seems out of focus.  Vote 4  Sonifo', '2002-11-11 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154285, 8124, 5064, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the lighting on this.</td>', 'Don''t like the lighting on this.', '2002-11-11 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154286, 8124, 4493, '<td valign="top">Focus is off, a little more contrast with the background and a touch of light on the front of the flower may also help.</td>', 'Focus is off, a little more contrast with the background and a touch of light on the front of the flower may also help.', '2002-11-11 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154287, 8124, 5082, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t appear to be in focus</td>', 'Doesn''t appear to be in focus', '2002-11-11 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154288, 8124, 1031, '<td valign="top">I want SOME part of the picture in sharp focus, or some rationale given for it not being so...</td>', 'I want SOME part of the picture in sharp focus, or some rationale given for it not being so...', '2002-11-12 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154289, 8124, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but looks a bit out of focus to me.</td>', 'Nice composition but looks a bit out of focus to me.', '2002-11-12 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154290, 8124, 3859, '<td valign="top">Pretty color, but not at all in focus. Nice composition, though.  Perhaps some better lighting would have helped your camera focus and brightened the scene a bit.</td>', 'Pretty color, but not at all in focus. Nice composition, though.  Perhaps some better lighting would have helped your camera focus and brightened the scene a bit.', '2002-11-12 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154291, 8124, 2635, '<td valign="top">a little out of focus .. nice shot otherwise - 5</td>', 'a little out of focus .. nice shot otherwise - 5', '2002-11-12 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154292, 8124, 3095, '<td valign="top">No macro function on the camera huh? I will give you the benefit of the doubt and give you a 5 for nice composition and colours.</td>', 'No macro function on the camera huh? I will give you the benefit of the doubt and give you a 5 for nice composition and colours.', '2002-11-12 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154293, 8124, 4536, '<td valign="top">I am sure you''ve heard this a bunch, but it lacks focus.<br/>I like the framing/color combination.</td>', 'I am sure you''ve heard this a bunch, but it lacks focus.I like the framing/color combination.', '2002-11-13 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154294, 8124, 3280, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus.  More frontal lighting may have helped that some and brought out your colors as well.  DPz</td>', 'A bit out of focus.  More frontal lighting may have helped that some and brought out your colors as well.  DPz', '2002-11-13 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154295, 8124, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much too soft and out of focus.  Good crop job.  Different background might have helped some.  Picture overall looks "dull".  This has potential and much that could have been done with it.</td>', 'Much too soft and out of focus.  Good crop job.  Different background might have helped some.  Picture overall looks "dull".  This has potential and much that could have been done with it.', '2002-11-14 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154296, 8124, 1005, '<td valign="top">Soft Focus?  6 Swash</td>', 'Soft Focus?  6 Swash', '2002-11-14 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154297, 8124, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute little flower.  Would need more focus.  Also this shot needs more lighting  ... you can use a brighter light source or  brighten it up using Paint Shop Pro or Photoshop (I had to do this for my Technology entry).  Jacko.</td>', 'Cute little flower.  Would need more focus.  Also this shot needs more lighting  ... you can use a brighter light source or  brighten it up using Paint Shop Pro or Photoshop (I had to do this for my Technology entry).  Jacko.', '2002-11-15 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154298, 8124, 4430, '<td valign="top">I like the background color, how shot was set up etc.. However, when I think of macro/close-up, I think of crisp, detailed pics.</td>', 'I like the background color, how shot was set up etc.. However, when I think of macro/close-up, I think of crisp, detailed pics.', '2002-11-15 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154299, 8124, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but focus could be improved.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'Very pretty, but focus could be improved.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154300, 8124, 4007, '<td valign="top">Needs to be in better focus.  The yellow background is a nice touch.  With a subject as generic and over-photographed as a flower you really need some unique perspective or way of presenting it that will make it unique and special.  The framing and angle and composition here don''t make it start apart, so you need to take a more creative approach. 1 wingy</td>', 'Needs to be in better focus.  The yellow background is a nice touch.  With a subject as generic and over-photographed as a flower you really need some unique perspective or way of presenting it that will make it unique and special.  The framing and angle and composition here don''t make it start apart, so you need to take a more creative approach. 1 wingy', '2002-11-18 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(154301, 8126, 5047, '<td valign="top">Nice color!</td>', 'Nice color!', '2002-11-11 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154302, 8126, 4210, '<td valign="top">This would have been neat if the paint was still wet and the brushes had paint on them... Good lighting.</td>', 'This would have been neat if the paint was still wet and the brushes had paint on them... Good lighting.', '2002-11-11 02:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154303, 8126, 2344, '<td valign="top">You need paint on that brush.</td>', 'You need paint on that brush.', '2002-11-11 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154304, 8126, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors..love this creative shot.</td>', 'Lovely colors..love this creative shot.', '2002-11-11 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154305, 8126, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Fresh paint would have made this picture even more dashing.  Jacko</td>', 'Nice idea.  Fresh paint would have made this picture even more dashing.  Jacko', '2002-11-11 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154306, 8126, 4793, '<td valign="top">I like your colors.</td>', 'I like your colors.', '2002-11-11 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154307, 8126, 4162, '<td valign="top">Similar idea to mine this week.  I love the colours of yours.  Think I would prefer it if the paints were still wet</td>', 'Similar idea to mine this week.  I love the colours of yours.  Think I would prefer it if the paints were still wet', '2002-11-11 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154308, 8126, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, but I''d stick with photography!!  Seems just a bit soft on the brush focus.  DPz</td>', 'Very colorful, but I''d stick with photography!!  Seems just a bit soft on the brush focus.  DPz', '2002-11-11 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154309, 8126, 4005, '<td valign="top">for me it would have looked better, when the brushes would have been also full of color! So it looks, somehow unnatural!<br/>But its a good idea and a nice shot nevertheless! 6 - KAOS</td>', 'for me it would have looked better, when the brushes would have been also full of color! So it looks, somehow unnatural!But its a good idea and a nice shot nevertheless! 6 - KAOS', '2002-11-12 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(154310, 8126, 1041, '<td valign="top">nice title<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- i would like to see the lower brush in focus also.  you have sufficient DOF to do this if you made sure the plane of the picture is parallel to your camera.  i like the colors in this shot a lot.<br/>composition -- did you try just one brush?  and maybe place it inbetween of the two current ones?  i would also add paint to the bristles.  i know that would make it a different photo, but it would look more realistic to me.  i don''t usually paint with two brushes like that and w/out paint on the brush.  but then, i don''t paint often.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'nice titlechallenge -- mettechnical -- i would like to see the lower brush in focus also.  you have sufficient DOF to do this if you made sure the plane of the picture is parallel to your camera.  i like the colors in this shot a lot.composition -- did you try just one brush?  and maybe place it inbetween of the two current ones?  i would also add paint to the bristles.  i know that would make it a different photo, but it would look more realistic to me.  i don''t usually paint with two brushes like that and w/out paint on the brush.  but then, i don''t paint often.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154311, 8126, 3669, '<td valign="top">This picture really stood out for me while I was scanning the thumbnails.  I love the colors.  This may sound REALLY picky, but I would have liked to have seen the paint brushes with paint on them...like the painting was a work in progress.</td>', 'This picture really stood out for me while I was scanning the thumbnails.  I love the colors.  This may sound REALLY picky, but I would have liked to have seen the paint brushes with paint on them...like the painting was a work in progress.', '2002-11-13 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154312, 8126, 3454, '<td valign="top">Where''s the wet paint on the brush? jk, good shot.</td>', 'Where''s the wet paint on the brush? jk, good shot.', '2002-11-13 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
