(154380, 8132, 4648, '<td valign="top">This pic tells one of two stories.  I''ll take the one of the man who works for the road department in paving side of it.  He works hard a relaxes by doing photography.  They say a writer should write about what he knows and the same with a photographer?  So he took a picture of his work boots.  Good pic, a little soft but still a good pic.  The boots show he is a hard worker and the photo shows he puts time into his pics.  Good choice of content.  Like the work material still on the boot - adds character.  I like it overall.  A good 6   PTL</td>', 'This pic tells one of two stories.  I''ll take the one of the man who works for the road department in paving side of it.  He works hard a relaxes by doing photography.  They say a writer should write about what he knows and the same with a photographer?  So he took a picture of his work boots.  Good pic, a little soft but still a good pic.  The boots show he is a hard worker and the photo shows he puts time into his pics.  Good choice of content.  Like the work material still on the boot - adds character.  I like it overall.  A good 6   PTL', '2002-11-15 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
