(154388, 8133, 3936, '<td valign="top">Actually the Cherenkov effect is sort of an electric blue.  Erie as hell as the glow floats on the surface.  (The object does not glow, the glow is produced by the radiation slowing down in water.  Which is probably more than you ever wanted to know. &amp;lt;grin&amp;gt;)  Nice depth of field, great effect,  and I particularly like the dead bug for atmosphere.  8</td>', 'Actually the Cherenkov effect is sort of an electric blue.  Erie as hell as the glow floats on the surface.  (The object does not glow, the glow is produced by the radiation slowing down in water.  Which is probably more than you ever wanted to know. &lt;grin&gt;)  Nice depth of field, great effect,  and I particularly like the dead bug for atmosphere.  8', '2002-11-14 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
