(154421, 8138, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- nice clarity on the bug.  i peersonally don''t like the pinkish background.  that''s because i have a thing for bright white ones, but also, because the color doesn''t really complement anything in the shot.  i just played around with your photo and upped the brightness and gamma, and the colors overall were much brighter.  i think i like that better.  email me if you want me to send you a copy.<br/>composition -- i would have preferred the whole bug in the picture.<br/>don''t get me wrong, this is not a bad photo.  those things that i listed above are just the ones that would''ve had me go ''wow'' more.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- nice clarity on the bug.  i peersonally don''t like the pinkish background.  that''s because i have a thing for bright white ones, but also, because the color doesn''t really complement anything in the shot.  i just played around with your photo and upped the brightness and gamma, and the colors overall were much brighter.  i think i like that better.  email me if you want me to send you a copy.composition -- i would have preferred the whole bug in the picture.don''t get me wrong, this is not a bad photo.  those things that i listed above are just the ones that would''ve had me go ''wow'' more.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
