(154451, 8141, 3506, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting for this subject.  I''d like the hand to take up the entire shot though so that the dark triangle in the lower-right isn''t a distraction.  (6)</td>', 'Excellent lighting for this subject.  I''d like the hand to take up the entire shot though so that the dark triangle in the lower-right isn''t a distraction.  (6)', '2002-11-11 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
