(154464, 8144, 3540, '<td valign="top">So far, the most original shot I''ve seen.  The light is good, DOF, focus are all  pretty well done.  The thing I see this lacking is some sort of focal point.  It could have been done with some subtlety and I''m not seeing it, or it should''ve been done a little more consciously so that we viewers are not running our eyes around the shot over and over and over. - Inspzil</td>', 'So far, the most original shot I''ve seen.  The light is good, DOF, focus are all  pretty well done.  The thing I see this lacking is some sort of focal point.  It could have been done with some subtlety and I''m not seeing it, or it should''ve been done a little more consciously so that we viewers are not running our eyes around the shot over and over and over. - Inspzil', '2002-11-11 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
