(154522, 8147, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, great texture and focus. I even like all the scratches on the forks. 9.</td>', 'Very nicely done, great texture and focus. I even like all the scratches on the forks. 9.', '2002-11-13 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154523, 8147, 92, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this !!!! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I LOVE this !!!! Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-15 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154524, 8147, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great lines.  I like the composition.  A tad more focus would be nice.  Jacko 7</td>', 'Great lines.  I like the composition.  A tad more focus would be nice.  Jacko 7', '2002-11-15 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154525, 8147, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  One of a kind.  Sometimes it is refreshing to see something different.  I like this.   photographically I like the tone and the composition.  Don''t know how it stand with others but it''s a solid 7 with me.  PTL</td>', 'Very creative.  One of a kind.  Sometimes it is refreshing to see something different.  I like this.   photographically I like the tone and the composition.  Don''t know how it stand with others but it''s a solid 7 with me.  PTL', '2002-11-16 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154526, 8147, 5121, '<td valign="top">Looks like Fork and Fork are having a fork (hee hee).  Interesting abstract.</td>', 'Looks like Fork and Fork are having a fork (hee hee).  Interesting abstract.', '2002-11-17 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154527, 8151, 3032, '<td valign="top">Focus.</td>', 'Focus.', '2002-11-11 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154528, 8151, 3575, '<td valign="top">The flower is not in sharp focus and I would have liked to have seen the flower on a tabletop or background other than being held. That''s probably why the flower isn''t sharp. It sure is a little one!</td>', 'The flower is not in sharp focus and I would have liked to have seen the flower on a tabletop or background other than being held. That''s probably why the flower isn''t sharp. It sure is a little one!', '2002-11-11 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154529, 8151, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met.  the fingers add a nice sense of scale to the shot.  that flower really is tiny!<br/>technical -- the focus seems to be on the fingers, rather than the flower.  that''s a hard one to get right in macro photography with the shallow DOF ...<br/>composition -- i''m slightly distracted by the thing to the right of the fingers.  what is it?  it doesn''t look like it belongs in the shot.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- met.  the fingers add a nice sense of scale to the shot.  that flower really is tiny!technical -- the focus seems to be on the fingers, rather than the flower.  that''s a hard one to get right in macro photography with the shallow DOF ...composition -- i''m slightly distracted by the thing to the right of the fingers.  what is it?  it doesn''t look like it belongs in the shot.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-11 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154530, 8151, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great detail and color. I''m not sure what that red thing on the right is though...</td>', 'Great detail and color. I''m not sure what that red thing on the right is though...', '2002-11-12 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154531, 8151, 3936, '<td valign="top">To me it seems a dark and contrast possibly a bit low.  The reddish object on the right side of the frame, competes for attention.  I do like the sense of scale that the fingers give to the flower.  5</td>', 'To me it seems a dark and contrast possibly a bit low.  The reddish object on the right side of the frame, competes for attention.  I do like the sense of scale that the fingers give to the flower.  5', '2002-11-12 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154532, 8151, 4361, '<td valign="top">thats right most of the smallest things are the most beautiful,</td>', 'thats right most of the smallest things are the most beautiful,', '2002-11-12 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154533, 8151, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great deatil on the fingertips!  Needs a bit more focus on the flower</td>', 'Great deatil on the fingertips!  Needs a bit more focus on the flower', '2002-11-12 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154534, 8151, 4648, '<td valign="top">Small ain''t the word for it.  Great way to display just how small.  Hope you haven''t committed a crime.  Your fingerprints are clear enough to convict you.  But the flower is just a little soft.  The only other thing I see is whatever is on the right side.  I''d a cropped it out.  Still you con''t complain about an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Small ain''t the word for it.  Great way to display just how small.  Hope you haven''t committed a crime.  Your fingerprints are clear enough to convict you.  But the flower is just a little soft.  The only other thing I see is whatever is on the right side.  I''d a cropped it out.  Still you con''t complain about an 8.  PTL', '2002-11-13 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154535, 8151, 518, '<td valign="top">focus!  by  the way, we''re running your fingerprints thru our files</td>', 'focus!  by  the way, we''re running your fingerprints thru our files', '2002-11-13 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154536, 8151, 4536, '<td valign="top">looks a bit grey.<br/>nice inclusion of the fingers, gives a sense of scale.</td>', 'looks a bit grey.nice inclusion of the fingers, gives a sense of scale.', '2002-11-15 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154537, 8153, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice still life.  Looks a little bit dark.</td>', 'Nice still life.  Looks a little bit dark.', '2002-11-11 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154538, 8153, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice crisp macro. I love the red and orange colours, with a nice tinge of green to make it nice and christmasy, one of my favs this week. 10 - Konador</td>', 'Really nice crisp macro. I love the red and orange colours, with a nice tinge of green to make it nice and christmasy, one of my favs this week. 10 - Konador', '2002-11-11 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154539, 8153, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.', '2002-11-11 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154540, 8153, 3280, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell it.  Good title as I''m not sure I would have known otherwise.  DPz</td>', 'I can almost smell it.  Good title as I''m not sure I would have known otherwise.  DPz', '2002-11-11 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154541, 8153, 4388, '<td valign="top">very nice, could use a little crispness</td>', 'very nice, could use a little crispness', '2002-11-11 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154542, 8153, 1041, '<td valign="top">i like the title, it gives me a very cozy feeling.  what is it that i''m looking at?  i''ll be interested to find out on monday.<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- i like the orange glow on the ... things ...  not sure about the contrast in the shadows, what would it look like if there was just a bit more detail there?<br/>composition -- the ''other'' rule of three ;) using three subjects always works well.  <br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'i like the title, it gives me a very cozy feeling.  what is it that i''m looking at?  i''ll be interested to find out on monday.challenge -- mettechnical -- i like the orange glow on the ... things ...  not sure about the contrast in the shadows, what would it look like if there was just a bit more detail there?composition -- the ''other'' rule of three ;) using three subjects always works well.  -- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154543, 8153, 3936, '<td valign="top">Picture is a bit dark, but could be this monitor.  Never seen a picture of "smells" before.  But this has to be about as close as you could come.  7</td>', 'Picture is a bit dark, but could be this monitor.  Never seen a picture of "smells" before.  But this has to be about as close as you could come.  7', '2002-11-12 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
