(154597, 8159, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have a problem with JPEG artifacts. I noticed that your shot is only at 70 kb.  I used to have the same problem when I saved my shots.  You need to make sure that you get them just under the 150 kb allowed when you save them in either PSP or PS.  Check the forums, chat room or e-mail me if you are unsure how.  DPz</td>', 'Looks like you have a problem with JPEG artifacts. I noticed that your shot is only at 70 kb.  I used to have the same problem when I saved my shots.  You need to make sure that you get them just under the 150 kb allowed when you save them in either PSP or PS.  Check the forums, chat room or e-mail me if you are unsure how.  DPz', '2002-11-12 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
