(154648, 8162, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the composition and the shadow too. IMHO it would be better with a less distracting background color. Good luck, nds</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the composition and the shadow too. IMHO it would be better with a less distracting background color. Good luck, nds', '2002-11-11 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
