(154733, 8172, 4648, '<td valign="top">I swear I voted on this earlier.  Maybe they rejected my vote because it was too high at 6.  Let me rethink it then.  Yes, it really is early.  Mine won''t be open for at least two more weeks or so.  My comment the first time about the color was "The color is perfect, with the exception of the dark background at the top. "  As I look at it again I like the background fine.  In fact I can''t find anything wrong this time.  Guess I''ll have to go with a 10 this time and put it in my favorites.  PTL</td>', 'I swear I voted on this earlier.  Maybe they rejected my vote because it was too high at 6.  Let me rethink it then.  Yes, it really is early.  Mine won''t be open for at least two more weeks or so.  My comment the first time about the color was "The color is perfect, with the exception of the dark background at the top. "  As I look at it again I like the background fine.  In fact I can''t find anything wrong this time.  Guess I''ll have to go with a 10 this time and put it in my favorites.  PTL', '2002-11-13 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
