(154793, 8175, 3317, '<td valign="top">real real pretty, like the horizon line that''s out of focus on the left and a reflection on the right. darn pretty, really though, gonna add this to my favorites. and you get a ten for sure. wow the curving lines on the lower right reflections wrap themselves around the holes, nice. don''t leave the house without your camera anymore.</td>', 'real real pretty, like the horizon line that''s out of focus on the left and a reflection on the right. darn pretty, really though, gonna add this to my favorites. and you get a ten for sure. wow the curving lines on the lower right reflections wrap themselves around the holes, nice. don''t leave the house without your camera anymore.', '2002-11-16 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154794, 8175, 1280, '<td valign="top">Sunglasses?  Good abstract and meets challenge. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'Sunglasses?  Good abstract and meets challenge. Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154795, 8175, 4811, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to thank everyone who voted and who left their helpful comments. This was my first submission to the site and the whole experience was great fun. BTW, it was a toothbrush holder on its side next to a moden-style metal fruit basket :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-23 14:30:58.</i></td>', 'Just wanted to thank everyone who voted and who left their helpful comments. This was my first submission to the site and the whole experience was great fun. BTW, it was a toothbrush holder on its side next to a moden-style metal fruit basket :)', '2002-11-18 08:58:00.000000', '2003-06-23 15:30:58.000000', 0),
(154796, 8176, 741, '<td valign="top">No real colour to catch the eye so the picture has to rely on texture.  I think it suffers from being front lit - cross lighting would have brought out more relief.  Framing on the lhs is a little off as well - I think it would have been better either to give it some space or close in tight like the rhs.</td>', 'No real colour to catch the eye so the picture has to rely on texture.  I think it suffers from being front lit - cross lighting would have brought out more relief.  Framing on the lhs is a little off as well - I think it would have been better either to give it some space or close in tight like the rhs.', '2002-11-12 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154797, 8176, 3936, '<td valign="top">Good eye.  Most folks would not have noticed.</td>', 'Good eye.  Most folks would not have noticed.', '2002-11-14 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
