(154799, 8176, 4648, '<td valign="top">How can I say this nicely?  Seriously?  Too boring.  Bad crop.  Too crowded.  Is sharp and and clear but that''s about all it has going for it.  Sorry 3.  PTL</td>', 'How can I say this nicely?  Seriously?  Too boring.  Bad crop.  Too crowded.  Is sharp and and clear but that''s about all it has going for it.  Sorry 3.  PTL', '2002-11-14 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154800, 8176, 1031, '<td valign="top">For this macro challenge, I''d have tried to zoom in a little tighter so that the main gourd almost completely fills the frame to emphasize the close-up effect. That would also show the detail in the two flaws better.</td>', 'For this macro challenge, I''d have tried to zoom in a little tighter so that the main gourd almost completely fills the frame to emphasize the close-up effect. That would also show the detail in the two flaws better.', '2002-11-15 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
