(154827, 8180, 1041, '<td valign="top">very nice cat shot.  i''m sure you get comments that there''s too many cats/flowers/babies ... luckily i like them when they are well done, and yours is.<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- great clarity and focus.  not totally convinced by your choice of sepia, but it''s not bad, either.  love the reflection in the eye.<br/>composition -- very nicely cropped and framed.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'very nice cat shot.  i''m sure you get comments that there''s too many cats/flowers/babies ... luckily i like them when they are well done, and yours is.challenge -- mettechnical -- great clarity and focus.  not totally convinced by your choice of sepia, but it''s not bad, either.  love the reflection in the eye.composition -- very nicely cropped and framed.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-11 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
