(154851, 8181, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- good clarity and focus on the eye.  the hotspots to the left above and below are distracting though.<br/>composition -- like the negative space.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- good clarity and focus on the eye.  the hotspots to the left above and below are distracting though.composition -- like the negative space.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-13 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154852, 8181, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job for the most part...the glare on the face and outer edge of the eye is harsh, but maybe that''s the look you were going for.  7  Grayce</td>', 'Good job for the most part...the glare on the face and outer edge of the eye is harsh, but maybe that''s the look you were going for.  7  Grayce', '2002-11-14 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154853, 8181, 4648, '<td valign="top">Sharp eye.  Would love to see the entire face.  Very interesting features surrounding the eye.  Intriguing.  Only complaint is the bright spot on the left side of the eye.  Would liked to have a better look at the eye.  Find myself wanting to zoom in on the eye more.  Would love to see the natural color of the eye.  Looks like it might be a green or hazel.  Interesting lines in the eye.  This picture leaves me wanting more.  Don''t know if that is good or bad as far as photography goes.  Really haveing trouble scoring this one - mainly because of what it makes me want.  Otherwise it is a really good shot.  Is 8 fair?  PTL</td>', 'Sharp eye.  Would love to see the entire face.  Very interesting features surrounding the eye.  Intriguing.  Only complaint is the bright spot on the left side of the eye.  Would liked to have a better look at the eye.  Find myself wanting to zoom in on the eye more.  Would love to see the natural color of the eye.  Looks like it might be a green or hazel.  Interesting lines in the eye.  This picture leaves me wanting more.  Don''t know if that is good or bad as far as photography goes.  Really haveing trouble scoring this one - mainly because of what it makes me want.  Otherwise it is a really good shot.  Is 8 fair?  PTL', '2002-11-14 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154854, 8181, 2247, '<td valign="top">Overall, nice pic.  The glare at the buttom is not bad, but at the top is.  Maybe next defuse your light with a filter to make it less harsh.  I love the skin tone and of course the eye itself is wonderfully contrasted with the shadow on the right of it.</td>', 'Overall, nice pic.  The glare at the buttom is not bad, but at the top is.  Maybe next defuse your light with a filter to make it less harsh.  I love the skin tone and of course the eye itself is wonderfully contrasted with the shadow on the right of it.', '2002-11-14 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154855, 8181, 4903, '<td valign="top">Nce shot, but the area of the eye is little bit over exposed.</td>', 'Nce shot, but the area of the eye is little bit over exposed.', '2002-11-15 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154856, 8181, 2221, '<td valign="top">I''m not 100% sure but I think it''s you Gordon ;-) Well done! The sharpness and clarity in your eye is outstanding. I think the overexposure adds to the photo. Somehow it makes your face look like painted with golden colour. I would have cropped a bit more from the left and bottom area.-stephan</td>', 'I''m not 100% sure but I think it''s you Gordon ;-) Well done! The sharpness and clarity in your eye is outstanding. I think the overexposure adds to the photo. Somehow it makes your face look like painted with golden colour. I would have cropped a bit more from the left and bottom area.-stephan', '2002-11-17 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154857, 8181, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well I''m flattered at being mistaken for Gordon, but I''m afriad you''ll have to look about 100 places higher to find him. = )</td>', 'Well I''m flattered at being mistaken for Gordon, but I''m afriad you''ll have to look about 100 places higher to find him. = )', '2002-11-18 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
