(154888, 8184, 4472, '<td valign="top">Nice comment on the challenge, average image with not enogh tonal variations</td>', 'Nice comment on the challenge, average image with not enogh tonal variations', '2002-11-11 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154889, 8184, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Creative.</td>', 'lol Creative.', '2002-11-11 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154890, 8184, 4388, '<td valign="top">can''t tell if it''s a cookie or concrete, cant really tell you why it''s not appealing.</td>', 'can''t tell if it''s a cookie or concrete, cant really tell you why it''s not appealing.', '2002-11-11 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154891, 8184, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know this is not a real flower, but maybe flour.  It is so neat.  Looks like cooking is all you have left to do.  Picture couldn''t get much better if it is what I think it is.  Would have liked it backed off of a little so I could see the edges of it.  But 7 is still mighty good.PTL</td>', 'I know this is not a real flower, but maybe flour.  It is so neat.  Looks like cooking is all you have left to do.  Picture couldn''t get much better if it is what I think it is.  Would have liked it backed off of a little so I could see the edges of it.  But 7 is still mighty good.PTL', '2002-11-12 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154892, 8184, 1041, '<td valign="top">LOL.  great idea.  for a second i was going to point out the typo, but then i realized ... <br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- well implemented.  good lighting.  i would like to see more contrast in the colors, but i realize flour doesn''t come in bright red/blue/green  :)<br/>composition -- also good.  nice crop with the middle of the flower just in the right spot.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'LOL.  great idea.  for a second i was going to point out the typo, but then i realized ... challenge -- mettechnical -- well implemented.  good lighting.  i would like to see more contrast in the colors, but i realize flour doesn''t come in bright red/blue/green  :)composition -- also good.  nice crop with the middle of the flower just in the right spot.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-13 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154893, 8184, 2123, '<td valign="top">Very clever :-)</td>', 'Very clever :-)', '2002-11-13 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154894, 8184, 3946, '<td valign="top">Cool!!  Something different.  I like....good job</td>', 'Cool!!  Something different.  I like....good job', '2002-11-14 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154895, 8184, 3936, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is, though that doesn''t matter for scoring.  It''s obviously a flower, just not sure made of what.  (Half the fun is figuring it out.)  Great detail, I like the lighting, because it emphasizes the texture.  Petals are a tiny bit distracting cut off, but not a real big deal.  7</td>', 'Not sure what this is, though that doesn''t matter for scoring.  It''s obviously a flower, just not sure made of what.  (Half the fun is figuring it out.)  Great detail, I like the lighting, because it emphasizes the texture.  Petals are a tiny bit distracting cut off, but not a real big deal.  7', '2002-11-14 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154896, 8184, 5208, '<td valign="top">"flowers" ? :-)</td>', '"flowers" ? :-)', '2002-11-15 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154897, 8184, 2716, '<td valign="top">That''s original.  What is that?  Looks like brown sugar and icing.  Nice shot.  Jacko. 7</td>', 'That''s original.  What is that?  Looks like brown sugar and icing.  Nice shot.  Jacko. 7', '2002-11-15 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154898, 8184, 4906, '<td valign="top">This really should have finished higher.</td>', 'This really should have finished higher.', '2002-11-22 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(154899, 8186, 92, '<td valign="top">I can''t even tell you what I like about this...but I love it ! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I can''t even tell you what I like about this...but I love it ! Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-11 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154900, 8186, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the subject. Nice layout.</td>', 'Good focus on the subject. Nice layout.', '2002-11-11 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154901, 8186, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2002-11-11 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154902, 8186, 4388, '<td valign="top">is this another piece of art?  I like the composition a lot, nice angle and lighting.</td>', 'is this another piece of art?  I like the composition a lot, nice angle and lighting.', '2002-11-11 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154903, 8186, 4465, '<td valign="top">crear mas arte sobre una obra de arte??...o sencillamente, crear arte con la fotografía, esto último es lo que yo prefiero... y sabes hacerlo.</td>', 'crear mas arte sobre una obra de arte??...o sencillamente, crear arte con la fotografía, esto último es lo que yo prefiero... y sabes hacerlo.', '2002-11-12 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154904, 8186, 3732, '<td valign="top">a somewhat strange man</td>', 'a somewhat strange man', '2002-11-13 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154905, 8186, 5175, '<td valign="top">Ooooh! Moody, I like it.</td>', 'Ooooh! Moody, I like it.', '2002-11-13 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154906, 8186, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met.  is this part of a statue?  what''s the material in the foreground?  i''ll be interested to find out on monday.<br/>technical -- great black background (i looove plain backgrounds), complements the black foreground well.  you also used your available DOF well.  good colors.<br/>composition -- i wonder if tilting the sculpture a little bit (so that the head is lower) would''ve allowed you to still have a lot of space around it, but not quite as much.  but, that''s just one idea, i also like what you did.<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- met.  is this part of a statue?  what''s the material in the foreground?  i''ll be interested to find out on monday.technical -- great black background (i looove plain backgrounds), complements the black foreground well.  you also used your available DOF well.  good colors.composition -- i wonder if tilting the sculpture a little bit (so that the head is lower) would''ve allowed you to still have a lot of space around it, but not quite as much.  but, that''s just one idea, i also like what you did.-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-13 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154907, 8186, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... I think you have chosen an excellent subject... this photo generates ''questions'' in my mind... that''s a good characteristic :)  great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... I think you have chosen an excellent subject... this photo generates ''questions'' in my mind... that''s a good characteristic :)  great shot :) - setzler', '2002-11-14 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154908, 8186, 4455, '<td valign="top">lovely name for your photo-anz</td>', 'lovely name for your photo-anz', '2002-11-16 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154909, 8186, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is more into modern art which isn''t my forte.  I really couldn''t tell you if this was good art or not.  As for a photo I like the composition of it filling 1/2 at the angle.  That''s neat.  It looks relaxed exception for the mouth expression.  Clear focus.  Don''t really see anything wrong technically.  Doesn''t possess the "wow" for me or appeal but is a good sold 7 photographicly.  PTL</td>', 'This is more into modern art which isn''t my forte.  I really couldn''t tell you if this was good art or not.  As for a photo I like the composition of it filling 1/2 at the angle.  That''s neat.  It looks relaxed exception for the mouth expression.  Clear focus.  Don''t really see anything wrong technically.  Doesn''t possess the "wow" for me or appeal but is a good sold 7 photographicly.  PTL', '2002-11-16 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(154910, 8186, 1748, '<td valign="top">love subject matter and composition excellent image</td>', 'love subject matter and composition excellent image', '2002-11-17 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154911, 8186, 3317, '<td valign="top">this guy looks a little down. maybe someone needs to give him a hug.</td>', 'this guy looks a little down. maybe someone needs to give him a hug.', '2002-11-17 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154912, 8188, 4493, '<td valign="top">I think cropping off the bottom of the center piece takes away from the balance of the scene. Lighting and focus is good.</td>', 'I think cropping off the bottom of the center piece takes away from the balance of the scene. Lighting and focus is good.', '2002-11-11 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154913, 8188, 327, '<td valign="top">Terrific lighting, colors.....nice macro. Justine</td>', 'Terrific lighting, colors.....nice macro. Justine', '2002-11-11 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154914, 8188, 5064, '<td valign="top">Good lighting</td>', 'Good lighting', '2002-11-11 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154915, 8188, 2716, '<td valign="top">Alright!  Super excellent use of the depth of field.  Congratulations on the nice set up.  Jacko. 9</td>', 'Alright!  Super excellent use of the depth of field.  Congratulations on the nice set up.  Jacko. 9', '2002-11-11 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154916, 8188, 2223, '<td valign="top">good DOF, framing could be more center.</td>', 'good DOF, framing could be more center.', '2002-11-11 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154917, 8188, 5082, '<td valign="top">Great DOF</td>', 'Great DOF', '2002-11-11 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154918, 8188, 5047, '<td valign="top">Very nice placement and DOF.</td>', 'Very nice placement and DOF.', '2002-11-11 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154919, 8188, 3540, '<td valign="top">Framing on this photo could be better IMO.  I think this was a pretty good idea, but a little more DOF and different positioning of the focal point would be beneficial.  Good luck, it is a nice image - Inspzil</td>', 'Framing on this photo could be better IMO.  I think this was a pretty good idea, but a little more DOF and different positioning of the focal point would be beneficial.  Good luck, it is a nice image - Inspzil', '2002-11-12 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154920, 8188, 1880, '<td valign="top">Nice example of shallow DOF...  I like this ...  8 ...  RLS (Some people don''t realize DOF includes in front of the subject as well as behind)</td>', 'Nice example of shallow DOF...  I like this ...  8 ...  RLS (Some people don''t realize DOF includes in front of the subject as well as behind)', '2002-11-12 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154921, 8188, 3730, '<td valign="top">fair attempt at the chess shots...the pieces aren''t too interesting to look at in my opinion</td>', 'fair attempt at the chess shots...the pieces aren''t too interesting to look at in my opinion', '2002-11-13 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154922, 8188, 4536, '<td valign="top">I like your use of selective depth of field, but think the composition could be improved.</td>', 'I like your use of selective depth of field, but think the composition could be improved.', '2002-11-14 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154923, 8188, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I kinda like how the front and back peices are slightly out of focus, but the center peice is well focused.</td>', 'Interesting. I kinda like how the front and back peices are slightly out of focus, but the center peice is well focused.', '2002-11-14 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154924, 8188, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t lide the focus job at all .  Crop not up to standards in my opinion.  Sorry  for the 4.  PTL</td>', 'Don''t lide the focus job at all .  Crop not up to standards in my opinion.  Sorry  for the 4.  PTL', '2002-11-14 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154925, 8188, 1031, '<td valign="top">That expression says "Chess? I thought we were going fox hunting!"</td>', 'That expression says "Chess? I thought we were going fox hunting!"', '2002-11-15 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154926, 8188, 3317, '<td valign="top">more board!</td>', 'more board!', '2002-11-17 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154927, 8188, 280, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, very helpful! There was something I didnt quite like about this picture when I submitted it, however I couldnt quite put my finger on it. That is until I got my first comment pointing out that the cropping at the bottom takes away from the overall balance. Oh well I''ll know what to do next time, Thanks all.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, very helpful! There was something I didnt quite like about this picture when I submitted it, however I couldnt quite put my finger on it. That is until I got my first comment pointing out that the cropping at the bottom takes away from the overall balance. Oh well I''ll know what to do next time, Thanks all.', '2002-11-18 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(154928, 8190, 2344, '<td valign="top">it''s missing something to give it that extra punch. A colourful background maybe? Maybe a low-end 35 mm camera?</td>', 'it''s missing something to give it that extra punch. A colourful background maybe? Maybe a low-end 35 mm camera?', '2002-11-11 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154929, 8190, 92, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity of this one. The black and yellow are wonderful. The very top just seems to need light. I would love to see this redone on black with that reflection !!!! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I love the clarity of this one. The black and yellow are wonderful. The very top just seems to need light. I would love to see this redone on black with that reflection !!!! Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-11 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154930, 8190, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL Love the title. Shot is very nice, love the color, light. Justine</td>', 'LOL Love the title. Shot is very nice, love the color, light. Justine', '2002-11-11 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154931, 8190, 4411, '<td valign="top">Good idea and a good enough photo, but doesn''t leap out and grab my attention. Maybe the lighting is too even around the side and the top too dark?</td>', 'Good idea and a good enough photo, but doesn''t leap out and grab my attention. Maybe the lighting is too even around the side and the top too dark?', '2002-11-11 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154932, 8190, 5023, '<td valign="top">good depth of field</td>', 'good depth of field', '2002-11-11 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154933, 8190, 3859, '<td valign="top">Great detail, but not very interesting.</td>', 'Great detail, but not very interesting.', '2002-11-11 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154934, 8190, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice depth of field and clarity.</td>', 'nice depth of field and clarity.', '2002-11-11 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154935, 8190, 3575, '<td valign="top">Beautifully sharp. I can read it without my glasses! Are you trying to say that once you go digital you never go back? It looks like this is an exposed roll, better get them developed! - 8</td>', 'Beautifully sharp. I can read it without my glasses! Are you trying to say that once you go digital you never go back? It looks like this is an exposed roll, better get them developed! - 8', '2002-11-12 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154936, 8190, 3454, '<td valign="top">Technically a good shot, nothing too engaging though.</td>', 'Technically a good shot, nothing too engaging though.', '2002-11-13 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154937, 8190, 3669, '<td valign="top">Because of the artifact from compression, it seems out of focus.  It shows up at the edges and becomes very distracting.  Otherwise, it would be a good shot technically.  However, the subject matter is rather uninteresting.</td>', 'Because of the artifact from compression, it seems out of focus.  It shows up at the edges and becomes very distracting.  Otherwise, it would be a good shot technically.  However, the subject matter is rather uninteresting.', '2002-11-13 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154938, 8190, 3280, '<td valign="top">Humorous but true.  Nice clear shot with good lighting and color.  DPz</td>', 'Humorous but true.  Nice clear shot with good lighting and color.  DPz', '2002-11-13 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154939, 8190, 3946, '<td valign="top">basic, simple, to the point, uninteresting.  Lots of compression clutter.</td>', 'basic, simple, to the point, uninteresting.  Lots of compression clutter.', '2002-11-13 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154940, 8190, 4210, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and reflection! I really like the background.</td>', 'Nice colour and reflection! I really like the background.', '2002-11-15 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154941, 8190, 4648, '<td valign="top">This would go well in the next challenge.  I still have some of the but no longer use them.  Great shot could be a commercial.  A lot of people try to go with the 1/3''s don''t they.  It doesn''t really make that much sense to me.  This would have been good not matter how cropped unless you cut off the top and bottom.  It''s a 9, and a high 9 at that.  PTL</td>', 'This would go well in the next challenge.  I still have some of the but no longer use them.  Great shot could be a commercial.  A lot of people try to go with the 1/3''s don''t they.  It doesn''t really make that much sense to me.  This would have been good not matter how cropped unless you cut off the top and bottom.  It''s a 9, and a high 9 at that.  PTL', '2002-11-16 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154942, 8190, 4617, '<td valign="top">well i can''t say a whole lot about my pass yet, i''m still shooting with a 35mm but this is a nice shot - vw4lyfe 7</td>', 'well i can''t say a whole lot about my pass yet, i''m still shooting with a 35mm but this is a nice shot - vw4lyfe 7', '2002-11-17 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
