(154948, 8191, 811, '<td valign="top">man I love these things.  I think for the picture, regular ones would have shown more contrast.</td>', 'man I love these things.  I think for the picture, regular ones would have shown more contrast.', '2002-11-11 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
