(154950, 8191, 4361, '<td valign="top">my kids dreams come true, they look like giant towers of cookies, very neat, i giveu a 7</td>', 'my kids dreams come true, they look like giant towers of cookies, very neat, i giveu a 7', '2002-11-12 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(154951, 8191, 3575, '<td valign="top">Yummy! This is a very good macro. The lighting is a little harsh in spots but I notice that sometimes photoshop can cause that effect when using the levels. Anyway, they look soooo good I''m going to have to go and buy some. 8 joanns</td>', 'Yummy! This is a very good macro. The lighting is a little harsh in spots but I notice that sometimes photoshop can cause that effect when using the levels. Anyway, they look soooo good I''m going to have to go and buy some. 8 joanns', '2002-11-12 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
