(155005, 8196, 1041, '<td valign="top">curious to see what it is that i''m actually looking at here.  hope you added this to your comments.<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- the photo is a little overpoweringly red/orange, even though i realize that''s due to the subject you have chosen.  reflection on the knot in the middle is a little distracting, but overall, you have managed reflections well, especially on the coins.<br/>composition -- too busy.  the middle knot and the coins fight for attention.  also, while the foreground is busy with the tassles, the background is bare, i would like to see more tassles there, too.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'curious to see what it is that i''m actually looking at here.  hope you added this to your comments.challenge -- mettechnical -- the photo is a little overpoweringly red/orange, even though i realize that''s due to the subject you have chosen.  reflection on the knot in the middle is a little distracting, but overall, you have managed reflections well, especially on the coins.composition -- too busy.  the middle knot and the coins fight for attention.  also, while the foreground is busy with the tassles, the background is bare, i would like to see more tassles there, too.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
