(155028, 8198, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- i like how the OOF at the bottom gives this pic a sense of depth.  i think this could''ve been achieved with less of the bottom (640x427 format), too.  nice sharp focus on the leaf and rope.<br/>composition -- like the depth achieved.  while this is a good photo technical i have to admit that i don''t find it very exciting, sorry.   <br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- i like how the OOF at the bottom gives this pic a sense of depth.  i think this could''ve been achieved with less of the bottom (640x427 format), too.  nice sharp focus on the leaf and rope.composition -- like the depth achieved.  while this is a good photo technical i have to admit that i don''t find it very exciting, sorry.   -- gr8photos.', '2002-11-14 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
