(155039, 8200, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those you can keep in your, not mine, home?  Some how that skin just doesn''t look like something I would want to cuddle up next to on the couch and pet, like my cat or dog.  The skin looks kinds rough, and - if you can understand this - looks like it stinks.  This picture comes alive.  Good 8. Has good photographic skills but doesn''t make me love the pig.   PTL</td>', 'Is this one of those you can keep in your, not mine, home?  Some how that skin just doesn''t look like something I would want to cuddle up next to on the couch and pet, like my cat or dog.  The skin looks kinds rough, and - if you can understand this - looks like it stinks.  This picture comes alive.  Good 8. Has good photographic skills but doesn''t make me love the pig.   PTL', '2002-11-13 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
