(155054, 8201, 4648, '<td valign="top">He''s not asleep.  His eyes are open.  He is so cute though.  Boston Terrier?  He so cute why couldn''t you get him in good focus.  He''s cuter than the picture shows.  I''m surprised it''s not in focus.  So don''t be surprised by this 4.  Sorry PTL</td>', 'He''s not asleep.  His eyes are open.  He is so cute though.  Boston Terrier?  He so cute why couldn''t you get him in good focus.  He''s cuter than the picture shows.  I''m surprised it''s not in focus.  So don''t be surprised by this 4.  Sorry PTL', '2002-11-14 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155055, 8201, 518, '<td valign="top">needs better focus</td>', 'needs better focus', '2002-11-14 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155056, 8201, 1792, '<td valign="top">Background seems distracting in upper left corner.  Possibly closer cropping could have emphasized the subject  more.</td>', 'Background seems distracting in upper left corner.  Possibly closer cropping could have emphasized the subject  more.', '2002-11-14 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155057, 8201, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met<br/>technical -- very grainy, and somewhat unsharp picture.  i''m not sure whether that''s due to your camera limitations or not ...<br/>composition -- love the look on the dogs face  :) <br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'challenge -- mettechnical -- very grainy, and somewhat unsharp picture.  i''m not sure whether that''s due to your camera limitations or not ...composition -- love the look on the dogs face  :) -- gr8photos', '2002-11-14 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155058, 8201, 1005, '<td valign="top">Heavy duty grain, sorry, do you have a very low end camera?  5 Swash</td>', 'Heavy duty grain, sorry, do you have a very low end camera?  5 Swash', '2002-11-14 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155059, 8201, 60, '<td valign="top">yea i guess i''d consider a cheap webcam a low end camera.  thx for not making me last place :)</td>', 'yea i guess i''d consider a cheap webcam a low end camera.  thx for not making me last place :)', '2002-11-18 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155060, 8202, 2344, '<td valign="top">I feel we''re missing out on the beauty of this flower. Bring it a little further into the frame (dont bring it completely in though you''ll ruin the effect!). I just feel that too much of the flower lies in shadow. We''re seeing the underside and the parts that need to be better illuminated. Great attempt!</td>', 'I feel we''re missing out on the beauty of this flower. Bring it a little further into the frame (dont bring it completely in though you''ll ruin the effect!). I just feel that too much of the flower lies in shadow. We''re seeing the underside and the parts that need to be better illuminated. Great attempt!', '2002-11-11 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155061, 8202, 2123, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I almost wish that top edge didn''t fade out, but a very effective photo, nonetheless. :-) 8 kathleenm</td>', 'Beautiful!  I almost wish that top edge didn''t fade out, but a very effective photo, nonetheless. :-) 8 kathleenm', '2002-11-11 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155062, 8202, 5023, '<td valign="top">wow cool ochid  and sharp too</td>', 'wow cool ochid  and sharp too', '2002-11-11 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155063, 8202, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I like the colors. I''d like to see more of the flower in the photo I think. The bottom is just so focused and then the top fades into the white which seems a little odd. Good job with lighting!  ~indi</td>', 'This is cool. I like the colors. I''d like to see more of the flower in the photo I think. The bottom is just so focused and then the top fades into the white which seems a little odd. Good job with lighting!  ~indi', '2002-11-11 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155064, 8202, 587, '<td valign="top">Awesome ladyslipper! My favorite orchids! A tad too bright for me at the top, but the colors are fab! Great photo! ~ cthenk</td>', 'Awesome ladyslipper! My favorite orchids! A tad too bright for me at the top, but the colors are fab! Great photo! ~ cthenk', '2002-11-11 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155065, 8202, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the detail shown with the little hairy things.  Great focus adn capture of detail.  karmat</td>', 'I like the colors and the detail shown with the little hairy things.  Great focus adn capture of detail.  karmat', '2002-11-11 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155066, 8202, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and excellent color.  A little burned out at the top though. DPz</td>', 'Very pretty and excellent color.  A little burned out at the top though. DPz', '2002-11-12 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155067, 8202, 133, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Not sure if I like it being 1/2 off the picture or not though.</td>', 'Nice.  Not sure if I like it being 1/2 off the picture or not though.', '2002-11-12 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155068, 8202, 1255, '<td valign="top">I like how this stands out from the background.  I wonder why it was cut off though.  I wish you could see more of it.  The line where it is cut off seems a bit awkard.</td>', 'I like how this stands out from the background.  I wonder why it was cut off though.  I wish you could see more of it.  The line where it is cut off seems a bit awkard.', '2002-11-13 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155069, 8202, 2716, '<td valign="top">I love the colours and the details, but I don''t understand the composition.  Less cropping (more flower, more centred) would have worked better for me.  7 Jacko</td>', 'I love the colours and the details, but I don''t understand the composition.  Less cropping (more flower, more centred) would have worked better for me.  7 Jacko', '2002-11-14 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155070, 8202, 4210, '<td valign="top">Nice colour, and the negative space is nice too.</td>', 'Nice colour, and the negative space is nice too.', '2002-11-14 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155071, 8202, 4648, '<td valign="top">Clear enough to see the hair on the flower.  Beautiful color.  Don''t know that I''ve seen this flower before.  A different crop than I would have done, but it works here.  Nice job.  6 for it.  PTL</td>', 'Clear enough to see the hair on the flower.  Beautiful color.  Don''t know that I''ve seen this flower before.  A different crop than I would have done, but it works here.  Nice job.  6 for it.  PTL', '2002-11-14 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155072, 8202, 3540, '<td valign="top">The choice of background here I think would''ve helped to provide some separation at the top of the plant (I think it''s a plant) with the white being around the edges and all.  The plant itself looks excellent, well focused and lit. - Inspzil</td>', 'The choice of background here I think would''ve helped to provide some separation at the top of the plant (I think it''s a plant) with the white being around the edges and all.  The plant itself looks excellent, well focused and lit. - Inspzil', '2002-11-15 05:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155073, 8202, 1280, '<td valign="top">This looks as odd as my submission.  People have questioned it because they''ve not seen it themselves.  Good capture and well composed.  The top of the flower seems over exposed...but I like it anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'This looks as odd as my submission.  People have questioned it because they''ve not seen it themselves.  Good capture and well composed.  The top of the flower seems over exposed...but I like it anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155074, 8202, 3317, '<td valign="top">might''ve worked better against a slightly darker background.</td>', 'might''ve worked better against a slightly darker background.', '2002-11-16 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155075, 8202, 2706, '<td valign="top">what is that anyway?</td>', 'what is that anyway?', '2002-11-16 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155076, 8202, 5110, '<td valign="top">what is this?athena</td>', 'what is this?athena', '2002-11-17 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155077, 8202, 5240, '<td valign="top">Nice Paph. Too bad it was not centered...a bit too much off center for me but for an orchid lover, great flower...prize winner for an orchid show!</td>', 'Nice Paph. Too bad it was not centered...a bit too much off center for me but for an orchid lover, great flower...prize winner for an orchid show!', '2002-11-17 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155078, 8202, 806, '<td valign="top">gorgeous colors! excellent how I can see every little hair-like structure! The composition seems a little off balance to me.... dunno,, as if the flower is falling somehow.. would like to see it either a bit more upright, or coming out of the corner more (maybe from bottom left).. Love the colors against the white..</td>', 'gorgeous colors! excellent how I can see every little hair-like structure! The composition seems a little off balance to me.... dunno,, as if the flower is falling somehow.. would like to see it either a bit more upright, or coming out of the corner more (maybe from bottom left).. Love the colors against the white..', '2002-11-17 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155079, 8204, 3080, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the whites is just a bit harsh.  It intrudes in on your subject in the bottom right of the bean.  The blurryness on the right is puzzling to me as well.  I could pass it off as DOF, but it also looks to have a motion blurr look to it.  I don''t think that appeals to me much.  your angle on the bean is good, and framing/cropping seem fine to me as well.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The brightness of the whites is just a bit harsh.  It intrudes in on your subject in the bottom right of the bean.  The blurryness on the right is puzzling to me as well.  I could pass it off as DOF, but it also looks to have a motion blurr look to it.  I don''t think that appeals to me much.  your angle on the bean is good, and framing/cropping seem fine to me as well.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155080, 8204, 4821, '<td valign="top">this picture makes me dizzy.</td>', 'this picture makes me dizzy.', '2002-11-11 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155081, 8204, 3032, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what to say about this, but it simply does not look good. Is it focus, the strange colors?<br/>No wait. This shot is ruined by horrible jpeg compression, the blocks are all over the plce, ruining the sharpness, the crispness, the colors, the detail etc etc.<br/>I don''t know if this was a pretty balanced shot to begin with, but  the shot is 35kb in size, where 150k is allowed.<br/>This looks like sh*t.</td>', 'Don''t know what to say about this, but it simply does not look good. Is it focus, the strange colors?No wait. This shot is ruined by horrible jpeg compression, the blocks are all over the plce, ruining the sharpness, the crispness, the colors, the detail etc etc.I don''t know if this was a pretty balanced shot to begin with, but  the shot is 35kb in size, where 150k is allowed.This looks like sh*t.', '2002-11-11 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155082, 8204, 3900, '<td valign="top">This makes me dizzy!! And thirsty for a cup.</td>', 'This makes me dizzy!! And thirsty for a cup.', '2002-11-12 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155083, 8204, 1005, '<td valign="top">There''s a wicked sense of motion about  this shot!  For some reason, the right side of this photo makes my eyes feel queesy.  I don''t know how you achieved this, but I like it.  9 Swash</td>', 'There''s a wicked sense of motion about  this shot!  For some reason, the right side of this photo makes my eyes feel queesy.  I don''t know how you achieved this, but I like it.  9 Swash', '2002-11-12 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155084, 8204, 4162, '<td valign="top">This would work well if the focus on the main coffee bean was sharper</td>', 'This would work well if the focus on the main coffee bean was sharper', '2002-11-12 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155085, 8204, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s way zoomed, more than its a macro.  I''m curious to know if it was done this way out of focus on purpose.  I''m just going to assume that it is and assume that you had a dozen cups or so before you shot this, tripodless of course :)  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Looks like it''s way zoomed, more than its a macro.  I''m curious to know if it was done this way out of focus on purpose.  I''m just going to assume that it is and assume that you had a dozen cups or so before you shot this, tripodless of course :)  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155086, 8204, 3532, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the yellow shadows and I wish a bit larger area was in focus.  I like the composition a lot though.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the yellow shadows and I wish a bit larger area was in focus.  I like the composition a lot though.', '2002-11-14 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155087, 8204, 2716, '<td valign="top">Pretty fuzzy and out of focus, though I admit it reflects the quality of my vision before I get that first cup into my blood system.   7 Jacko</td>', 'Pretty fuzzy and out of focus, though I admit it reflects the quality of my vision before I get that first cup into my blood system.   7 Jacko', '2002-11-14 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155088, 8204, 3320, '<td valign="top">Goo</td>', 'Goo', '2002-11-17 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155089, 8204, 4430, '<td valign="top">This would be great if it were more in focus.</td>', 'This would be great if it were more in focus.', '2002-11-17 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155090, 8204, 2535, '<td valign="top">freaky! playing with my eyes.</td>', 'freaky! playing with my eyes.', '2002-11-17 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155091, 8205, 4986, '<td valign="top">sorry.</td>', 'sorry.', '2002-11-11 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155092, 8205, 5047, '<td valign="top">Neat..</td>', 'Neat..', '2002-11-11 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155093, 8205, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is a good macro shot, but not a very interesting subject.  Maybe color would have made it more interesting. Like the shadow.</td>', 'This is a good macro shot, but not a very interesting subject.  Maybe color would have made it more interesting. Like the shadow.', '2002-11-11 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155094, 8205, 4297, '<td valign="top">overexposed<br/></td>', 'overexposed', '2002-11-11 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155095, 8205, 4493, '<td valign="top">Dimples are a little washed out. Perhaps having the light further back would have helped.<br/></td>', 'Dimples are a little washed out. Perhaps having the light further back would have helped.', '2002-11-11 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155096, 8205, 2716, '<td valign="top">Thanks alot!  I was trying to get over golf (season''s over here).  Nice subject, however the harsh light (flash) washed out the details of the golf ball.  Good luck on the course.  Jacko.</td>', 'Thanks alot!  I was trying to get over golf (season''s over here).  Nice subject, however the harsh light (flash) washed out the details of the golf ball.  Good luck on the course.  Jacko.', '2002-11-11 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155097, 8205, 3575, '<td valign="top">A bit over exposed. Nice idea and set up.</td>', 'A bit over exposed. Nice idea and set up.', '2002-11-11 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155098, 8205, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least on my monitor it got a little washed-out. Fro this kind of photo I expect (and prefer) to see all the dimples.</td>', 'At least on my monitor it got a little washed-out. Fro this kind of photo I expect (and prefer) to see all the dimples.', '2002-11-12 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155099, 8205, 3032, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit boring this way. Subject and background are not related.<br/>It would have been nicer when it was shot on the green, a bunker or just the grass in the park or your garden. What would add to that is a focus on the ball and using DOF to get a blurred background with a flagpole by the hole or something like that.<br/>For this shot: good focus, but too much light on top of the ball and a light or reflective white paper on the other side could have done something about the shadow.</td>', 'It''s a bit boring this way. Subject and background are not related.It would have been nicer when it was shot on the green, a bunker or just the grass in the park or your garden. What would add to that is a focus on the ball and using DOF to get a blurred background with a flagpole by the hole or something like that.For this shot: good focus, but too much light on top of the ball and a light or reflective white paper on the other side could have done something about the shadow.', '2002-11-12 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155100, 8205, 3280, '<td valign="top">The ball seems a bit burned out.  Good focus thought.  DPz</td>', 'The ball seems a bit burned out.  Good focus thought.  DPz', '2002-11-12 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155101, 8205, 2247, '<td valign="top">Your pic is spoiled by having it dead centered.  I think it would have turned out better if you had off-center it to the right.  That way, the shadow would have pointed back to the ball.</td>', 'Your pic is spoiled by having it dead centered.  I think it would have turned out better if you had off-center it to the right.  That way, the shadow would have pointed back to the ball.', '2002-11-14 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155102, 8205, 4648, '<td valign="top">A little too much light and washed out the dimples on top.  Meets the challenge well.  Pretty good pic.  Good 6.  PTL</td>', 'A little too much light and washed out the dimples on top.  Meets the challenge well.  Pretty good pic.  Good 6.  PTL', '2002-11-15 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155103, 8205, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think colour may have been a better choice over grayscale: you have nice texture, and the wood would have made the golf ball stand out more.</td>', 'I think colour may have been a better choice over grayscale: you have nice texture, and the wood would have made the golf ball stand out more.', '2002-11-15 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155104, 8205, 4517, '<td valign="top">not very interesting</td>', 'not very interesting', '2002-11-16 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155105, 8205, 3320, '<td valign="top">Sorry , not very good, shadow too stong, white too btight, wtong graming (move the ball a little on the right, with the shadow going on the left, you can. The lower left ''thing'' in the surface is very distracting, it looks too much likte the border of the table. 4. Lionel</td>', 'Sorry , not very good, shadow too stong, white too btight, wtong graming (move the ball a little on the right, with the shadow going on the left, you can. The lower left ''thing'' in the surface is very distracting, it looks too much likte the border of the table. 4. Lionel', '2002-11-17 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155106, 8205, 3317, '<td valign="top">a little overly lit.</td>', 'a little overly lit.', '2002-11-17 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155107, 8205, 5077, '<td valign="top">Over exposed, otherwise a nice shot...</td>', 'Over exposed, otherwise a nice shot...', '2002-11-17 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155108, 8205, 806, '<td valign="top">the ball is a bit overexposed on the top, and I am not sure, but I think it is causing the name of the ball to appear more out of focus than it should be. Also, placing the ball on a solid color backdrop would make this shot more appealing. .. and placing the ball further to one side of the frame.</td>', 'the ball is a bit overexposed on the top, and I am not sure, but I think it is causing the name of the ball to appear more out of focus than it should be. Also, placing the ball on a solid color backdrop would make this shot more appealing. .. and placing the ball further to one side of the frame.', '2002-11-17 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155109, 8208, 2716, '<td valign="top">No offense to granny/grampy, but this shot is not very appealing because of skin texture and the little red sore..   Nice detail on the hearing aid. Jacko. 4.</td>', 'No offense to granny/grampy, but this shot is not very appealing because of skin texture and the little red sore..   Nice detail on the hearing aid. Jacko. 4.', '2002-11-11 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(155110, 8208, 1880, '<td valign="top">Skin tones don''t look natural ...</td>', 'Skin tones don''t look natural ...', '2002-11-11 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155111, 8208, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met.  definitely a close-up macro (you were covering both bases here, weren''t you?  ;)<br/>technical -- great clarity and focus.  how did this look in b&amp;w?  the colors here don''t do much for me (appears a bit yellow in places), which is why i''m wondering about b&amp;w.<br/>composition -- good, even though i''d like to see the top of the ear, too.  that''s minor.  the angle feels a bit funny, i think because the ear is diagonal in the shot.  did you try portrait format?<br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- met.  definitely a close-up macro (you were covering both bases here, weren''t you?  ;)technical -- great clarity and focus.  how did this look in b&w?  the colors here don''t do much for me (appears a bit yellow in places), which is why i''m wondering about b&w.composition -- good, even though i''d like to see the top of the ear, too.  that''s minor.  the angle feels a bit funny, i think because the ear is diagonal in the shot.  did you try portrait format?-- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155112, 8208, 4361, '<td valign="top">gross, this picture is really close, i think it is a little too close for my tummy,  6</td>', 'gross, this picture is really close, i think it is a little too close for my tummy,  6', '2002-11-13 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155113, 8208, 4648, '<td valign="top">What can you say when the shot shows the tiny little blood vessels on the face and ear - in a photography contest.  The contrast between the hearing ear and the body is fantastic.  Good commercial shot for the hearing aid.  Can''t get much better than a 9 and I hate to give 10''s.  It takes "wow" and great eye appeal to get the 10 along with everything right technically.  The more I look and think the more I must give the 10.  Great shot.  PTL  Probably not a 1st place but photographlcly a 10.</td>', 'What can you say when the shot shows the tiny little blood vessels on the face and ear - in a photography contest.  The contrast between the hearing ear and the body is fantastic.  Good commercial shot for the hearing aid.  Can''t get much better than a 9 and I hate to give 10''s.  It takes "wow" and great eye appeal to get the 10 along with everything right technically.  The more I look and think the more I must give the 10.  Great shot.  PTL  Probably not a 1st place but photographlcly a 10.', '2002-11-16 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155114, 8211, 3859, '<td valign="top">Too much white space to be a macro of the flower.</td>', 'Too much white space to be a macro of the flower.', '2002-11-11 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155115, 8211, 327, '<td valign="top">OOF huh!? Interesting crop. Keep shooting.</td>', 'OOF huh!? Interesting crop. Keep shooting.', '2002-11-11 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155116, 8211, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the colours look a bit harsh.  Like the white background.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the colours look a bit harsh.  Like the white background.  Jacko.', '2002-11-11 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155117, 8211, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s kinda artsy, but I honestly don''t care for it.  The lack of detail bothers me most, then the blown out background is a strong "next".  4 Swash</td>', 'It''s kinda artsy, but I honestly don''t care for it.  The lack of detail bothers me most, then the blown out background is a strong "next".  4 Swash', '2002-11-11 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155118, 8211, 92, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this that just grabs me. I love that it takes up so little of the frame. That balance and watercolor effect it has. I like ! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'There''s something about this that just grabs me. I love that it takes up so little of the frame. That balance and watercolor effect it has. I like ! Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-11 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155119, 8211, 3280, '<td valign="top">I love the negative space and color but it seems really blown out.  DPz</td>', 'I love the negative space and color but it seems really blown out.  DPz', '2002-11-11 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155120, 8211, 4430, '<td valign="top">I like how this shot was set up, I just wish it were a lot more in focus.</td>', 'I like how this shot was set up, I just wish it were a lot more in focus.', '2002-11-15 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155121, 8211, 3317, '<td valign="top">a little too blown out.</td>', 'a little too blown out.', '2002-11-16 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155122, 8211, 4648, '<td valign="top">Way toomuch empty space for me personally.  Also too much of the flower out of focus and too bright on the very top of it.  This is just my personal appeal.  This is probably what you meant to do, and being new that I am it doesn''t appeal personally.  Sorry.  But I will give at a 4.  PTL</td>', 'Way toomuch empty space for me personally.  Also too much of the flower out of focus and too bright on the very top of it.  This is just my personal appeal.  This is probably what you meant to do, and being new that I am it doesn''t appeal personally.  Sorry.  But I will give at a 4.  PTL', '2002-11-16 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155123, 8211, 2706, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but where you cut and pasted is a bit noticable</td>', 'i like the idea, but where you cut and pasted is a bit noticable', '2002-11-16 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155124, 8211, 4186, '<td valign="top">i''d just like to comment in response to a few comments i received.<br/><br/>po: i did not cut and paste anything. this is a photo. i will show you the original if you like. the background was sky, which was so bright in contrast to the flowers that camera captured it as white. cutting and pasting would be illegal. the only cut was to remove the top 53 rows of pixels to bring it down to 640x427<br/><br/>the blown out effect was intentional. i liked it in the original, so i played with the contrast etc to accentuate it. same with the colors.<br/><br/>yes. it is supposed to be lacking detail, have bright colors, lots of negative space, and be a little of the fuzzy side. thank you for noticing.<br/><br/>if anyone is interested, the title and inspiration came from a song by nine inch nails called "i''m looking forward to joining you, finally"</td>', 'i''d just like to comment in response to a few comments i received.po: i did not cut and paste anything. this is a photo. i will show you the original if you like. the background was sky, which was so bright in contrast to the flowers that camera captured it as white. cutting and pasting would be illegal. the only cut was to remove the top 53 rows of pixels to bring it down to 640x427the blown out effect was intentional. i liked it in the original, so i played with the contrast etc to accentuate it. same with the colors.yes. it is supposed to be lacking detail, have bright colors, lots of negative space, and be a little of the fuzzy side. thank you for noticing.if anyone is interested, the title and inspiration came from a song by nine inch nails called "i''m looking forward to joining you, finally"', '2002-11-18 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155125, 8212, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good contrast of colors</td>', 'Good contrast of colors', '2002-11-11 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155126, 8212, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this, and I think you have done a good job.  The only negative I''ve got is that it looks a little "flat" (no pun intended).  If there had been some way to "elevate" heart so that it cast a shadow, it may have given it a "deeper" feeling. karmat</td>', 'I really like the idea of this, and I think you have done a good job.  The only negative I''ve got is that it looks a little "flat" (no pun intended).  If there had been some way to "elevate" heart so that it cast a shadow, it may have given it a "deeper" feeling. karmat', '2002-11-11 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155127, 8212, 3956, '<td valign="top">Very Creative....<br/>I love it...<br/>I would have cleaned it up a bit by fixing the white spots on the notes and the one on the cany heart.... but again...wonderfully creative.<br/>Cheers!</td>', 'Very Creative....I love it...I would have cleaned it up a bit by fixing the white spots on the notes and the one on the cany heart.... but again...wonderfully creative.Cheers!', '2002-11-11 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
