(155146, 8213, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great level of detail.  I love the framing.</td>', 'Great level of detail.  I love the framing.', '2002-11-17 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155147, 8215, 4514, '<td valign="top">There is a great way to get rid of the effect that underwater photographers call snow.  What you do is take the picture with the light at a 45 degree angle of the focal point and you woudl get rid of the floaters.</td>', 'There is a great way to get rid of the effect that underwater photographers call snow.  What you do is take the picture with the light at a 45 degree angle of the focal point and you woudl get rid of the floaters.', '2002-11-11 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155148, 8215, 3127, '<td valign="top">A little too blurry</td>', 'A little too blurry', '2002-11-11 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155149, 8215, 3859, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but lacks focus.  I am sure it was hard focusing thru glass and water.  Did you try putting your lens right up to the glass?  I have a rubber lens hood that makes taking pics in aquariums a bit easier by pressing it up to the glass.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Interesting, but lacks focus.  I am sure it was hard focusing thru glass and water.  Did you try putting your lens right up to the glass?  I have a rubber lens hood that makes taking pics in aquariums a bit easier by pressing it up to the glass.  Just a thought.', '2002-11-12 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155150, 8215, 4162, '<td valign="top">Even though the glass is dirty and the focus is off, there is something appealing in the shot, another world feeling!</td>', 'Even though the glass is dirty and the focus is off, there is something appealing in the shot, another world feeling!', '2002-11-12 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155151, 8215, 3540, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few issues with this photo that I don''t like, so don''t take this like I hate the picture, because I don''t.  first is focus.  second is glare, 3rd is other noise, 4th is the colors aren''t jumping out, 5th is I could never take this shot and I''m envious because you can, and did. - Good luck, Inspzil</td>', 'There are quite a few issues with this photo that I don''t like, so don''t take this like I hate the picture, because I don''t.  first is focus.  second is glare, 3rd is other noise, 4th is the colors aren''t jumping out, 5th is I could never take this shot and I''m envious because you can, and did. - Good luck, Inspzil', '2002-11-13 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155152, 8215, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not quite focused.  Too dark.  still better than avaerage.  A high 5.  PTL</td>', 'Not quite focused.  Too dark.  still better than avaerage.  A high 5.  PTL', '2002-11-14 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155153, 8216, 3936, '<td valign="top">Looks like your camera focused on the closer flower bud (see bud at lower right) leaving the bee out of focus.  Love the colors.  7</td>', 'Looks like your camera focused on the closer flower bud (see bud at lower right) leaving the bee out of focus.  Love the colors.  7', '2002-11-11 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155154, 8216, 4210, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours (especially the wings the same colour as the flower). I''m wondering if you''ve blurred it a little, or if it was just a touch out of focus...</td>', 'Beautiful colours (especially the wings the same colour as the flower). I''m wondering if you''ve blurred it a little, or if it was just a touch out of focus...', '2002-11-11 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155155, 8216, 4514, '<td valign="top">Faster shutter needed in my oppinion.  Other wise great shot.  Good color.  Too bad no depth.</td>', 'Faster shutter needed in my oppinion.  Other wise great shot.  Good color.  Too bad no depth.', '2002-11-11 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155156, 8216, 1041, '<td valign="top">i love bug shots!  (i bet you are not hearing this very often here ;)<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- the focus seems to be a little stronger on the flower than on the bee.  a difficult thing to get right with the shallow DOF that digital cameras have in macro mode.  i like the plain but not totally uniform background.  overall colors are great, the purple tinge of the wings is nicely complemented by the flower.<br/>composition -- great.  outside of this challenge, i would clone out those green bits at the bottom of the flower.<br/>good shot<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'i love bug shots!  (i bet you are not hearing this very often here ;)challenge -- mettechnical -- the focus seems to be a little stronger on the flower than on the bee.  a difficult thing to get right with the shallow DOF that digital cameras have in macro mode.  i like the plain but not totally uniform background.  overall colors are great, the purple tinge of the wings is nicely complemented by the flower.composition -- great.  outside of this challenge, i would clone out those green bits at the bottom of the flower.good shot-- gr8photos', '2002-11-11 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155157, 8216, 4411, '<td valign="top">Not really sharp enough - a tough subject to capture.</td>', 'Not really sharp enough - a tough subject to capture.', '2002-11-11 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
