(155159, 8216, 2716, '<td valign="top">That is one furry bee.  They''re tough to focus, aren''t they?  Nice bright colours.  Must have played with the saturation quite a bit to get this effect.  Good show. Jacko 7</td>', 'That is one furry bee.  They''re tough to focus, aren''t they?  Nice bright colours.  Must have played with the saturation quite a bit to get this effect.  Good show. Jacko 7', '2002-11-11 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
