(155162, 8216, 4648, '<td valign="top">If you are from the Atlanta, Georgia area that is not a bee!!  That is a YELLOW JACKET which BULLDOGS love to eat.  If it had been a BULLDOG it would have been a 10 even if it was fuzzy.  But since it''s a yellow jacket with a fuzzy head it is only an 8.  Forgetting the school riveraly it really is a good picture but still and 8. PTL</td>', 'If you are from the Atlanta, Georgia area that is not a bee!!  That is a YELLOW JACKET which BULLDOGS love to eat.  If it had been a BULLDOG it would have been a 10 even if it was fuzzy.  But since it''s a yellow jacket with a fuzzy head it is only an 8.  Forgetting the school riveraly it really is a good picture but still and 8. PTL', '2002-11-12 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155163, 8216, 3669, '<td valign="top">You picked up really nice colors on the bumble bee and I like the light streaming up from the bottom.  Just a wee outta focus, unfortunately that distracts from the picture.</td>', 'You picked up really nice colors on the bumble bee and I like the light streaming up from the bottom.  Just a wee outta focus, unfortunately that distracts from the picture.', '2002-11-13 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
