(155282, 8226, 3936, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field for such high magnification.  Lighting is reasonalbe for the subject.  However, picture is a bit dark over all.  Perhaps some work in a photo editing program to lighten it up, or a different surface, or colored surface to add some life to the picture.   It tends to come across as a random jumble of crystals on a dark grey surface.  Has potential to be much more.  You are on the right track with good instincts.  Going with a 6 here.</td>', 'Good depth of field for such high magnification.  Lighting is reasonalbe for the subject.  However, picture is a bit dark over all.  Perhaps some work in a photo editing program to lighten it up, or a different surface, or colored surface to add some life to the picture.   It tends to come across as a random jumble of crystals on a dark grey surface.  Has potential to be much more.  You are on the right track with good instincts.  Going with a 6 here.', '2002-11-17 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
