(155302, 8227, 4648, '<td valign="top">Who woulda thought.  I love the colors and the title sure fits.  Wasn''t sure at first but this one grows on you the more you look at it.  At first I thought a 5 but the more I look it is a 7 for sure.  PTL</td>', 'Who woulda thought.  I love the colors and the title sure fits.  Wasn''t sure at first but this one grows on you the more you look at it.  At first I thought a 5 but the more I look it is a 7 for sure.  PTL', '2002-11-16 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
