(155310, 8229, 3280, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot!  I have so many questions though.  The only nitpik I have is that the background lights take away from it.  The dessert looks fantastic, I wonder what it is.  One of my favorites this week.  DPz</td>', 'GREAT shot!  I have so many questions though.  The only nitpik I have is that the background lights take away from it.  The dessert looks fantastic, I wonder what it is.  One of my favorites this week.  DPz', '2002-11-13 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155311, 8229, 4210, '<td valign="top">Creative idea to use a reflection in your close up shot!</td>', 'Creative idea to use a reflection in your close up shot!', '2002-11-14 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
