(155322, 8230, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring and composition.  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice coloring and composition.  Great shot.', '2002-11-12 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155323, 8230, 3280, '<td valign="top">I like it alot.  The colors, texture and lighting all add up to warmth and lightness.  Very good feel.  DPz</td>', 'I like it alot.  The colors, texture and lighting all add up to warmth and lightness.  Very good feel.  DPz', '2002-11-12 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155324, 8230, 1041, '<td valign="top">heh.  i was going to enter a feather shot on white paper, too.  :)<br/>challenge -- met<br/>technical -- i would like to see the background being more white and less structured so that the user is more focused on the feather''s details.  good focus overall.  i think it''s ok that some of the feather tips are out of focus, but i suspect you will get comments that don''t like it.  just different opinions.<br/>composition -- maybe cutting a little more off the bottom and adding a little more to the top would''ve balanced the picture a bit better, at the moment it seems a bit top-heavy to me.  i like the overall concept of your crop though.<br/>-- gr8photos</td>', 'heh.  i was going to enter a feather shot on white paper, too.  :)challenge -- mettechnical -- i would like to see the background being more white and less structured so that the user is more focused on the feather''s details.  good focus overall.  i think it''s ok that some of the feather tips are out of focus, but i suspect you will get comments that don''t like it.  just different opinions.composition -- maybe cutting a little more off the bottom and adding a little more to the top would''ve balanced the picture a bit better, at the moment it seems a bit top-heavy to me.  i like the overall concept of your crop though.-- gr8photos', '2002-11-13 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155325, 8230, 806, '<td valign="top">You may see more tiny detail against a darker backdrop... as the white gets lost against the white.</td>', 'You may see more tiny detail against a darker backdrop... as the white gets lost against the white.', '2002-11-15 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155326, 8230, 5121, '<td valign="top">Gotta love the lovebirds!  I used to have one this colour.  Nice greens and greys, well framed, I really like this one!</td>', 'Gotta love the lovebirds!  I used to have one this colour.  Nice greens and greys, well framed, I really like this one!', '2002-11-16 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
