(155377, 8233, 4648, '<td valign="top">This would make a great "texture" shot.  I don''t care to get so up and close with my dog''s snout.  Smeared to many lenses this way.  Great shot for the challenge.  Doesn''t make for a "wow" photo but right on for the challenge.  very inspirational 7 though.  PTL</td>', 'This would make a great "texture" shot.  I don''t care to get so up and close with my dog''s snout.  Smeared to many lenses this way.  Great shot for the challenge.  Doesn''t make for a "wow" photo but right on for the challenge.  very inspirational 7 though.  PTL', '2002-11-14 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
