(155386, 8233, 3859, '<td valign="top">Thanks, mag.  No, doggy wasn''t sleeping.  Hubby gave her a treat each time she held still for a shot.  After about a dozen tries, she got the hang of it.  Be still while I stick a camera in her face and she gets a biscuit. It was a win/win situation.  She loved the biscuit treats and I love this shot.</td>', 'Thanks, mag.  No, doggy wasn''t sleeping.  Hubby gave her a treat each time she held still for a shot.  After about a dozen tries, she got the hang of it.  Be still while I stick a camera in her face and she gets a biscuit. It was a win/win situation.  She loved the biscuit treats and I love this shot.', '2002-11-18 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
