(155522, 8242, 3981, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture!  A 9 from me, and it would have been 10 if the bird were not so much on the left side of the photo. In my estimation, the composition would have been better had you been able to place the bird a little more to the right.  Bitz</td>', 'Wonderful picture!  A 9 from me, and it would have been 10 if the bird were not so much on the left side of the photo. In my estimation, the composition would have been better had you been able to place the bird a little more to the right.  Bitz', '2002-11-11 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
