(155533, 8242, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is this thing alive or stuffed.  His eye matches his beak.  Guess with a chest like that it could be a her eye.  Very clean clear well cropped shot.  Quality wise it deserves a 10, but somehow I can''t see it getting first place.  Still must give it the 10.  Don''t think others will though.  PTL</td>', 'Is this thing alive or stuffed.  His eye matches his beak.  Guess with a chest like that it could be a her eye.  Very clean clear well cropped shot.  Quality wise it deserves a 10, but somehow I can''t see it getting first place.  Still must give it the 10.  Don''t think others will though.  PTL', '2002-11-13 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
