(155538, 8242, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good.  Title was a little misleading----however I didn''t take that into consideration when I voted.  The composition and simplicity are effective.</td>', 'Good.  Title was a little misleading----however I didn''t take that into consideration when I voted.  The composition and simplicity are effective.', '2002-11-14 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155539, 8242, 5121, '<td valign="top">I love Cornwall, and that''s the place to shoot gulls!  and I got plenty of ''em!  Nice profile; yellow and black works great!</td>', 'I love Cornwall, and that''s the place to shoot gulls!  and I got plenty of ''em!  Nice profile; yellow and black works great!', '2002-11-16 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155540, 8242, 472, '<td valign="top">how did u get so close ?</td>', 'how did u get so close ?', '2002-11-18 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155541, 8242, 2634, '<td valign="top">For those of you wondering if this was telephoto or close up heres the story. I was at the aquarium by the ocean, and there were a lot of sea gulls around. One landed on a picnic table. I tried taking some shots with stuff in the background. Then I moved around it until I got a plain wall behind( new it would make for a better shot). Took about 3 shots from approximately 18 inches away(going closer each time). Then he decided to fly off.<br/> By the way I think it is ironic that my best shot at the aquarium was of a bird!</td>', 'For those of you wondering if this was telephoto or close up heres the story. I was at the aquarium by the ocean, and there were a lot of sea gulls around. One landed on a picnic table. I tried taking some shots with stuff in the background. Then I moved around it until I got a plain wall behind( new it would make for a better shot). Took about 3 shots from approximately 18 inches away(going closer each time). Then he decided to fly off. By the way I think it is ironic that my best shot at the aquarium was of a bird!', '2002-11-18 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155542, 8243, 4514, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  What is reflecting in the eye? Causes a distraction to the overall picture.</td>', 'Cute shot.  What is reflecting in the eye? Causes a distraction to the overall picture.', '2002-11-11 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155543, 8243, 4472, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection in the eye</td>', 'Nice reflection in the eye', '2002-11-11 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
