(155661, 8253, 4267, '<td valign="top">The pic is a macro of a turtle poking his head out of his body... I was dissapointed in my score as I thought I did a great job of getting in really close and maintaining a good focus.... the orange thing in front is the edge of his shell... I left it in the crop because I thought it would give some depth to the pic and show how he was backed up inside his shell... oh well live and learn.. thanks for the critiques and comments everyone<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'The pic is a macro of a turtle poking his head out of his body... I was dissapointed in my score as I thought I did a great job of getting in really close and maintaining a good focus.... the orange thing in front is the edge of his shell... I left it in the crop because I thought it would give some depth to the pic and show how he was backed up inside his shell... oh well live and learn.. thanks for the critiques and comments everyone~anachronite', '2002-11-18 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155662, 8254, 2123, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal! 9 kathleenm</td>', 'Phenomenal! 9 kathleenm', '2002-11-11 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155663, 8254, 3127, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo - incredible detail</td>', 'Beautiful photo - incredible detail', '2002-11-11 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155664, 8254, 3540, '<td valign="top">I have mixed emotions about this picture.  The focus and framing are very good.  The one thing that sticks in my mind is about how the butterfly is turned so that the wings are not so visible.  I thought it was a bee at first.  A little better angle to illustrate the wings a little more would''ve really helped the shot showing more color, clarifying the subject and maybe help the shallow DOF to bring the subject more into focus.  Just what I think though - Inspzil</td>', 'I have mixed emotions about this picture.  The focus and framing are very good.  The one thing that sticks in my mind is about how the butterfly is turned so that the wings are not so visible.  I thought it was a bee at first.  A little better angle to illustrate the wings a little more would''ve really helped the shot showing more color, clarifying the subject and maybe help the shallow DOF to bring the subject more into focus.  Just what I think though - Inspzil', '2002-11-12 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155665, 8254, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  This type butterfly is usually very nervous.  (I can never get them to sit still enough to shoot them!!!)  Very good clarity!  Score upgrade!  10 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  This type butterfly is usually very nervous.  (I can never get them to sit still enough to shoot them!!!)  Very good clarity!  Score upgrade!  10 Swash', '2002-11-12 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155666, 8254, 4648, '<td valign="top">I notice we are getting more moths than butterflies this time of year.  Still a good shot.  Would have been better from top side and behind him.  That would have added 2 more points for me.  His wings are a little out of focus but like that tongue down in the flower.  That adds 2 back.  Still comes out a good 7.  PTL</td>', 'I notice we are getting more moths than butterflies this time of year.  Still a good shot.  Would have been better from top side and behind him.  That would have added 2 more points for me.  His wings are a little out of focus but like that tongue down in the flower.  That adds 2 back.  Still comes out a good 7.  PTL', '2002-11-12 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155667, 8254, 133, '<td valign="top">Really nice close up!</td>', 'Really nice close up!', '2002-11-13 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155668, 8254, 1255, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great closeup.  Looks like the bug is saying, "Hey! This is my turf!"</td>', 'Wow!  Great closeup.  Looks like the bug is saying, "Hey! This is my turf!"', '2002-11-13 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155669, 8254, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the colors and details you have captured.  karmat</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the colors and details you have captured.  karmat', '2002-11-15 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155670, 8254, 3205, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!!...I love the composition and the colors!!...very well shot!!  Great Job!! you should be very proud!</td>', 'Fabulous!!...I love the composition and the colors!!...very well shot!!  Great Job!! you should be very proud!', '2002-11-15 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155671, 8254, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good job capturing this...this....um...what is it?  Anyway it really is good even if I can''t identify it.  That''s quite a straw he has.  I wish I captured this image.  Congrats!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'Very good job capturing this...this....um...what is it?  Anyway it really is good even if I can''t identify it.  That''s quite a straw he has.  I wish I captured this image.  Congrats!  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155672, 8254, 4517, '<td valign="top">strange looking bug. That one long tongue.Very interesting 9 marbo</td>', 'strange looking bug. That one long tongue.Very interesting 9 marbo', '2002-11-16 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155673, 8254, 5121, '<td valign="top">You''ve filled the frame with contrasting, bright colours, superb! A little more space needed at the bottom of the picture so as not to cut the little critters leg off, otherwise nice and sharp and a good job!</td>', 'You''ve filled the frame with contrasting, bright colours, superb! A little more space needed at the bottom of the picture so as not to cut the little critters leg off, otherwise nice and sharp and a good job!', '2002-11-16 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
