(155681, 8255, 3981, '<td valign="top">Normally, shots like this do not appeal to me personally.  However, your composition and lighting are excellent in my view.  I like it!  7.  Bitz</td>', 'Normally, shots like this do not appeal to me personally.  However, your composition and lighting are excellent in my view.  I like it!  7.  Bitz', '2002-11-11 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
