(155685, 8255, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the majority of the composition on this one.  A couple things are coming to my attention here.  First is the angle.  It seems for whatever reason, I would prefer the image tiliting the other way.  the 2nd thing is he lights showing at the bottom.  I feel they need to be in the pic, or out of it, not partly both - Inspzil</td>', 'I like the majority of the composition on this one.  A couple things are coming to my attention here.  First is the angle.  It seems for whatever reason, I would prefer the image tiliting the other way.  the 2nd thing is he lights showing at the bottom.  I feel they need to be in the pic, or out of it, not partly both - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155686, 8255, 3697, '<td valign="top">Awesome, a great photo of something that is not that easy to photograph. :)</td>', 'Awesome, a great photo of something that is not that easy to photograph. :)', '2002-11-13 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155687, 8255, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice colours/effect.  I love the lines.  Jacko.</td>', 'Nice colours/effect.  I love the lines.  Jacko.', '2002-11-14 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155688, 8255, 2437, '<td valign="top">all i can say is WOW</td>', 'all i can say is WOW', '2002-11-15 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155689, 8255, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!  Like the angle too.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)</td>', 'Good job!  Like the angle too.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce :-)', '2002-11-16 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155690, 8255, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great shot for the challenge.  I would like to see the whole car, personally.  The shot is beautiful though.  Love how you got from light on one side to light on other side.  Don''t think it''ll get 1st place but the pic is a solid 10.  PTL  Thumbnail doesn''t do it justice.  From the thumbnail it is a 5.  From the whole car it would be a 100.</td>', 'Great shot for the challenge.  I would like to see the whole car, personally.  The shot is beautiful though.  Love how you got from light on one side to light on other side.  Don''t think it''ll get 1st place but the pic is a solid 10.  PTL  Thumbnail doesn''t do it justice.  From the thumbnail it is a 5.  From the whole car it would be a 100.', '2002-11-16 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155691, 8255, 5121, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop and angle!</td>', 'Interesting crop and angle!', '2002-11-17 04:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
