(155722, 8258, 4648, '<td valign="top">Basketball team?  Which is the subject here - Kings #3 or the ball.  The picture doesn''t really tell me the story with half of it out of focus.  The writing is very clear and sharp but the orange out of focus ruins it.  Sorry but can''t possible give more than a 3.  PTL</td>', 'Basketball team?  Which is the subject here - Kings #3 or the ball.  The picture doesn''t really tell me the story with half of it out of focus.  The writing is very clear and sharp but the orange out of focus ruins it.  Sorry but can''t possible give more than a 3.  PTL', '2002-11-12 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
