(155748, 8261, 3859, '<td valign="top">Too much in the picture to be a macro, in my opinion.  A real tight closeup of the cat''s face would have been nice.</td>', 'Too much in the picture to be a macro, in my opinion.  A real tight closeup of the cat''s face would have been nice.', '2002-11-11 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155749, 8261, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective.</td>', 'Love the perspective.', '2002-11-11 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155750, 8261, 4536, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but  it could be improved upon. The shadows are distracting and the white object in the lower corner is too. If I didn''t know any better, I''d say you stole my cat:).</td>', 'I like the idea, but  it could be improved upon. The shadows are distracting and the white object in the lower corner is too. If I didn''t know any better, I''d say you stole my cat:).', '2002-11-11 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155751, 8261, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this being a macro.  The thing I do see is the thumb or finger at the bottom of the pic.  That, I would imagine, is getting mentioned by anyone looking at the pic closely enough.  Taking the pic while in the shadows is not a good idea, IMO.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t see this being a macro.  The thing I do see is the thumb or finger at the bottom of the pic.  That, I would imagine, is getting mentioned by anyone looking at the pic closely enough.  Taking the pic while in the shadows is not a good idea, IMO.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-13 04:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155752, 8261, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute, but what is he hunting?  Shadows?  I guess that''s something my dog or cat would do.</td>', 'Very cute, but what is he hunting?  Shadows?  I guess that''s something my dog or cat would do.', '2002-11-13 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
