(155754, 8261, 4648, '<td valign="top">Ths sure is getting up close and personal with the cat.  Love this cat''s eye view of the field.  Is the mouse at the edge of the yard in front of the bush on the right side?  Or is that a rabbit?  Hope he catches it.  Gotta give an 8 for this one.  PTL</td>', 'Ths sure is getting up close and personal with the cat.  Love this cat''s eye view of the field.  Is the mouse at the edge of the yard in front of the bush on the right side?  Or is that a rabbit?  Hope he catches it.  Gotta give an 8 for this one.  PTL', '2002-11-13 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155755, 8261, 1031, '<td valign="top">In the context of this macro challenge I think too much of the frame devoted to the larger landscape. If it were re-framed or cropped so the top of the dog''s ears hit the top of the frame, it would create more of a sense that you''re seeing what the dog is seeing, and offer a better look at that beautiful fur..</td>', 'In the context of this macro challenge I think too much of the frame devoted to the larger landscape. If it were re-framed or cropped so the top of the dog''s ears hit the top of the frame, it would create more of a sense that you''re seeing what the dog is seeing, and offer a better look at that beautiful fur..', '2002-11-17 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155756, 8262, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks more like it WAS Jack last night...I don''tknow about now!</td>', 'Looks more like it WAS Jack last night...I don''tknow about now!', '2002-11-12 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
