(155758, 8262, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good job of taking me back to my childhood days.  And this is not your run of the mill "Jack in the Box".   If you want to get rid of it, let me know.  I''d love to take it off you hands.  It would have a place of honor on my shelf.  As a childhood memory it is a 10, same as your photo.  PTL</td>', 'Good job of taking me back to my childhood days.  And this is not your run of the mill "Jack in the Box".   If you want to get rid of it, let me know.  I''d love to take it off you hands.  It would have a place of honor on my shelf.  As a childhood memory it is a 10, same as your photo.  PTL', '2002-11-14 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
