(155848, 8266, 2079, '<td valign="top">A beautiful work of art. This is my favorite picture in the challenge. 10  Gotcha Good Luck</td>', 'A beautiful work of art. This is my favorite picture in the challenge. 10  Gotcha Good Luck', '2002-11-17 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(155849, 8266, 1, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful.  well done.</td>', 'simply beautiful.  well done.', '2002-11-18 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155850, 8266, 4156, '<td valign="top">Thank you very kindly to everyone that took the time to comment!  A couple of you thought this little guy was not real and referred to a white line in the photo.  I was really stumped for a while about this and then I finally saw what I now believe to be a dog hair.  He stays mainly in the water and gets pretty sticky when he starts to dry.  He would tolerate shooting for about 2 minutes then off the spoon he''d hop, sometimes landing not quite on all fours.  I would then pick the debris from the carpet off his sticky skin, and shoot for a couple more minutes before I put him up....guess I missed a hair and never noticed it in the shot.  Amandolin, you are right!  I was wondering if anyone would notice!  He is actually an Oriental Fire Bellied Toad, but for title purposes he became a frog for the week.</td>', 'Thank you very kindly to everyone that took the time to comment!  A couple of you thought this little guy was not real and referred to a white line in the photo.  I was really stumped for a while about this and then I finally saw what I now believe to be a dog hair.  He stays mainly in the water and gets pretty sticky when he starts to dry.  He would tolerate shooting for about 2 minutes then off the spoon he''d hop, sometimes landing not quite on all fours.  I would then pick the debris from the carpet off his sticky skin, and shoot for a couple more minutes before I put him up....guess I missed a hair and never noticed it in the shot.  Amandolin, you are right!  I was wondering if anyone would notice!  He is actually an Oriental Fire Bellied Toad, but for title purposes he became a frog for the week.', '2002-11-18 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155851, 8266, 1255, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  One of my two 10''s for the week.  Congrats!</td>', 'Awesome shot!  One of my two 10''s for the week.  Congrats!', '2002-11-18 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155852, 8266, 4564, '<td valign="top">BRAVO!  Perfect shot!</td>', 'BRAVO!  Perfect shot!', '2002-11-18 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155853, 8266, 2283, '<td valign="top">I am curious, what did u use to hold the spoon, and for a backdrop?</td>', 'I am curious, what did u use to hold the spoon, and for a backdrop?', '2002-11-18 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155854, 8266, 472, '<td valign="top">im glad this won. this was an incredible shot : ) ...</td>', 'im glad this won. this was an incredible shot : ) ...', '2002-11-18 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155855, 8266, 2178, '<td valign="top">Congrats! I loved this shot the best. I cant even imagine how the hell 2 people gave you a 1 on this. A 10 from me by the way. Great job!</td>', 'Congrats! I loved this shot the best. I cant even imagine how the hell 2 people gave you a 1 on this. A 10 from me by the way. Great job!', '2002-11-18 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155856, 8266, 4388, '<td valign="top">Congradulations on the great winning photo! Excellent! I''m also interested in how you did it.  I read your comments.  You could give some of us amateurs some pointers.  It looks like you had top right and lower left lighting.  <br/>But I was also wondering what you used to hold the spoon and how you did the gradient background?  I know that background can be done with software but how did you do it without software?</td>', 'Congradulations on the great winning photo! Excellent! I''m also interested in how you did it.  I read your comments.  You could give some of us amateurs some pointers.  It looks like you had top right and lower left lighting.  But I was also wondering what you used to hold the spoon and how you did the gradient background?  I know that background can be done with software but how did you do it without software?', '2002-11-18 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155857, 8266, 3575, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Just like the rest of your photos this is supurb. Your colorful backgrounds are always so perfect! I see that I''m not the only one wanting to know how you get your backgrounds so perfect. Please share your secret. (I don''t think you''ll have anybody debating the worthiness of your win this week!</td>', 'Congratulations! Just like the rest of your photos this is supurb. Your colorful backgrounds are always so perfect! I see that I''m not the only one wanting to know how you get your backgrounds so perfect. Please share your secret. (I don''t think you''ll have anybody debating the worthiness of your win this week!', '2002-11-18 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155858, 8266, 772, '<td valign="top">******<br/>Gracechild7 - 11/11/2002<br/>Nice colour. Would have been awesome if it was a real frog, but we do what we can. :)<br/>******<br/><br/>I wanna know what gracechild thinks now... since it is a real frog, is it more awesome that it was to start with?  <br/><br/>Rackat, excellent shot :)</td>', '******Gracechild7 - 11/11/2002Nice colour. Would have been awesome if it was a real frog, but we do what we can. :)******I wanna know what gracechild thinks now... since it is a real frog, is it more awesome that it was to start with?  Rackat, excellent shot :)', '2002-11-18 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155859, 8266, 5121, '<td valign="top">Somehow missed this one when voting.  Congrats on a deserved win!</td>', 'Somehow missed this one when voting.  Congrats on a deserved win!', '2002-11-18 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155860, 8266, 2780, '<td valign="top">*******<br/>jmsetzler<br/>since it is a real frog, is it more awesome that it was to start with? <br/>*******<br/><br/>it''s a toad ;)</td>', '*******jmsetzlersince it is a real frog, is it more awesome that it was to start with? *******it''s a toad ;)', '2002-11-18 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155861, 8266, 2244, '<td valign="top">Wow....Wow is all I can say!  Extremely well/professionally executed. The background color works very well (especially the color variation).  This toad definately has modelling aspirations!  Very well deserved!</td>', 'Wow....Wow is all I can say!  Extremely well/professionally executed. The background color works very well (especially the color variation).  This toad definately has modelling aspirations!  Very well deserved!', '2002-11-18 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155862, 8266, 4689, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Super colors. I''m a newbie here, but I thought the rules said you couldn''t doctor the photo. I had Oriental Fire Bellied Toads before. They didn''t have red toes or that pattern on their chest. It was basically orange on the belly, no pattern. Is this a new type, or is it ok to play with colors?</td>', 'Great photo. Super colors. I''m a newbie here, but I thought the rules said you couldn''t doctor the photo. I had Oriental Fire Bellied Toads before. They didn''t have red toes or that pattern on their chest. It was basically orange on the belly, no pattern. Is this a new type, or is it ok to play with colors?', '2002-11-18 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155863, 8266, 2178, '<td valign="top">Id really like to see a setup shot on this, maybe one taken back several feet to get good idea how this was done. Always looking to learn as much as I can. I enjoy showing setups and sharing the know how. thanks! :)</td>', 'Id really like to see a setup shot on this, maybe one taken back several feet to get good idea how this was done. Always looking to learn as much as I can. I enjoy showing setups and sharing the know how. thanks! :)', '2002-11-18 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155864, 8266, 2780, '<td valign="top">Yes, I''d really like to see the technique to get the great colour background!</td>', 'Yes, I''d really like to see the technique to get the great colour background!', '2002-11-20 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155865, 8266, 4536, '<td valign="top">This is a well deserved win.<br/>Curious as to why you haven''t shared your setup/technique, most of us would like to learn from this photo.<br/>Thanks.</td>', 'This is a well deserved win.Curious as to why you haven''t shared your setup/technique, most of us would like to learn from this photo.Thanks.', '2002-11-20 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155866, 8266, 4210, '<td valign="top">Yeah, -hangs head-, sorry I didn''t realize it was real. As I mentioned in my PM to Rackat I just assumed a frog-like being with those colourings would be too poisonous to use as a subject, so therefore it couldn''t possibly be real. It is a really great photo though.</td>', 'Yeah, -hangs head-, sorry I didn''t realize it was real. As I mentioned in my PM to Rackat I just assumed a frog-like being with those colourings would be too poisonous to use as a subject, so therefore it couldn''t possibly be real. It is a really great photo though.', '2002-11-20 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(155867, 8267, 2978, '<td valign="top">This texture interests me. Just wanna see a bit more contrast</td>', 'This texture interests me. Just wanna see a bit more contrast', '2002-11-11 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
