(155893, 8268, 4305, '<td valign="top">OH! WOW! I TOOK A STEP BACK WHEN I SAW THIS. (TO GET THE WHOLE THING.) I LOVE IT! ITS WONDERFUL! ITS AN AMAZING PHOTOGRAPH THAT WILL SURELY AND SIMPLY GIVE YOU A SURE FIRE FIRST PLACE WINNER! ...0.00001</td>', 'OH! WOW! I TOOK A STEP BACK WHEN I SAW THIS. (TO GET THE WHOLE THING.) I LOVE IT! ITS WONDERFUL! ITS AN AMAZING PHOTOGRAPH THAT WILL SURELY AND SIMPLY GIVE YOU A SURE FIRE FIRST PLACE WINNER! ...0.00001', '2002-11-15 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
