(155908, 8269, 3540, '<td valign="top">It looks harder to focus this picture like this, than it would be to give a little more DOF to the strings.  Its strangely focused for about 1" of the strings.  Neat trick but not so sure I like it.  Is this a left handed bass?  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'It looks harder to focus this picture like this, than it would be to give a little more DOF to the strings.  Its strangely focused for about 1" of the strings.  Neat trick but not so sure I like it.  Is this a left handed bass?  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-15 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
