(155918, 8270, 1143, '<td valign="top">YAY for focus! There just isnt enough in these entries  *sigh*  I like how it glows. Good job with lighting it. I''m not sure I like the crop. I don''t like the extra space on the left and that the top and bottom are cut. I think that if you are gonna crop it tight you shoulda tried it as a portrait and just focused on the part with the piano. Quality is evident tho even if the subject doesn''t jump out.  ~indi</td>', 'YAY for focus! There just isnt enough in these entries  *sigh*  I like how it glows. Good job with lighting it. I''m not sure I like the crop. I don''t like the extra space on the left and that the top and bottom are cut. I think that if you are gonna crop it tight you shoulda tried it as a portrait and just focused on the part with the piano. Quality is evident tho even if the subject doesn''t jump out.  ~indi', '2002-11-12 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
