(156106, 8288, 3080, '<td valign="top">While the shot is technically well done, the subject doesn''t really interest me much at all.  It''s a great close up, focus is good, and lighting seems just fine.  The 3 blades, or weeds, that are in the 1 bottom left, 2 bottom right, and 3, straight through vertically just to the right of the photo are a tad distracting from the actual ground grass.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'While the shot is technically well done, the subject doesn''t really interest me much at all.  It''s a great close up, focus is good, and lighting seems just fine.  The 3 blades, or weeds, that are in the 1 bottom left, 2 bottom right, and 3, straight through vertically just to the right of the photo are a tad distracting from the actual ground grass.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-11 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156107, 8288, 4388, '<td valign="top">i think i can tell what you are trying to do, but it just didn''t work.</td>', 'i think i can tell what you are trying to do, but it just didn''t work.', '2002-11-11 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
