(156119, 8290, 811, '<td valign="top">This picture would have been much more effective if it had been slightly more focused.  Would it have been possible to have more light so that the shutter speed would be slower?  karmat<br/><br/>Amendment:  If this is the one in the forums referred to as "fuzzy navel"  your humor is appreciated.  Maybe if you could have had a narrow depth of field, so that part of focused and part was not, it would be more easily understood.</td>', 'This picture would have been much more effective if it had been slightly more focused.  Would it have been possible to have more light so that the shutter speed would be slower?  karmatAmendment:  If this is the one in the forums referred to as "fuzzy navel"  your humor is appreciated.  Maybe if you could have had a narrow depth of field, so that part of focused and part was not, it would be more easily understood.', '2002-11-11 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
