(156144, 8291, 4648, '<td valign="top">Where?  It must have flown away.  But good picture of an awesome unique light and feather.  Shame you titled it wrong.  Show me the mosquito.  Unless that means light in another language or something like that.  I still like the photo, even with the bright light.  So much that it gets a 6 from me.  PTL</td>', 'Where?  It must have flown away.  But good picture of an awesome unique light and feather.  Shame you titled it wrong.  Show me the mosquito.  Unless that means light in another language or something like that.  I still like the photo, even with the bright light.  So much that it gets a 6 from me.  PTL', '2002-11-13 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156145, 8291, 3540, '<td valign="top">I am not really seeing this as a macro.  The "mosquito" is way overexposed and it looks like the persons right arm was moving.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'I am not really seeing this as a macro.  The "mosquito" is way overexposed and it looks like the persons right arm was moving.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-15 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
