(156196, 8298, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge -- met.  what are these?  look like rubber bands.<br/>technical -- good focus.  a couple of minor hotspots but they are not very distracting, so that''s ok.  i like that you chose the yellow background, it works well here.<br/>composition -- there''s too much chaos here for my personal liking.  i would like for something (and i''m not sure how to do that with the subject matter) to be the main focus, rather than the whole photo.  <br/>-- gr8photos.</td>', 'challenge -- met.  what are these?  look like rubber bands.technical -- good focus.  a couple of minor hotspots but they are not very distracting, so that''s ok.  i like that you chose the yellow background, it works well here.composition -- there''s too much chaos here for my personal liking.  i would like for something (and i''m not sure how to do that with the subject matter) to be the main focus, rather than the whole photo.  -- gr8photos.', '2002-11-12 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
