(165592, 8242, 1005, '<td valign="top">Terry, this has to be one of THE best photos in the animals section, so far.  (I just remembered the photo Not So Soft {I think was the title}, which is an all time fav of mine)  The amount of detail in this shot is totally amazing.  Just how close were you?  (Oh 18 inches...)  I love the irony!</td>', 'Terry, this has to be one of THE best photos in the animals section, so far.  (I just remembered the photo Not So Soft {I think was the title}, which is an all time fav of mine)  The amount of detail in this shot is totally amazing.  Just how close were you?  (Oh 18 inches...)  I love the irony!', '2002-12-06 13:01:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(165693, 8184, 1041, '<td valign="top">i agree :)INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(174498, 7869, 2158, '<td valign="top">After seeing the "My worst shot" thread in the forums, I just had to come and take a look.  This has to be one of the greatest cases of someone learning from past results that I''ve seen on this site.</td>', 'After seeing the "My worst shot" thread in the forums, I just had to come and take a look.  This has to be one of the greatest cases of someone learning from past results that I''ve seen on this site.', '2002-12-17 19:31:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(175292, 8097, 1042, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing that people will think you''ve ripped off an "original" idea from someone in here when, in fact that person saw it in a magazine first. I like this photo..just thought I''d say so. There always seem to be a few idiots in here looking to bash everything though. Good luck in the future. :)</td>', 'It''s amazing that people will think you''ve ripped off an "original" idea from someone in here when, in fact that person saw it in a magazine first. I like this photo..just thought I''d say so. There always seem to be a few idiots in here looking to bash everything though. Good luck in the future. :)', '2002-12-19 10:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(189645, 8253, 3080, '<td valign="top">While I realize that the red is part of his shell, I do think it''s a bit distracting.  With the tight crop, I think it would be ok if you cropped that out too.  I don''t think it would damage the photo in any way.  I like the tight crop, I think that it enhances the "macro effect".  your focus and clarity are great, and the lighting is good.  A little more light wouldn''t have hurt, but I think it''s ok the way it is.  What a cutie!</td>', 'While I realize that the red is part of his shell, I do think it''s a bit distracting.  With the tight crop, I think it would be ok if you cropped that out too.  I don''t think it would damage the photo in any way.  I like the tight crop, I think that it enhances the "macro effect".  your focus and clarity are great, and the lighting is good.  A little more light wouldn''t have hurt, but I think it''s ok the way it is.  What a cutie!', '2003-01-13 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(191958, 8065, 2003, '<td valign="top">hey i liked this enuf to give it a 6 - apparently it sunk deep into my subconscious, because my BODY PARTS submission 6 weeks later looked very similar  ... <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=10082" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">BLEAGH</a> <br/> <br/>funny - i didn''t get as many bad reviews as you did, but still didn''t score very high</td>', 'hey i liked this enuf to give it a 6 - apparently it sunk deep into my subconscious, because my BODY PARTS submission 6 weeks later looked very similar  ... BLEAGH  funny - i didn''t get as many bad reviews as you did, but still didn''t score very high', '2003-01-15 13:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(202400, 8161, 1005, '<td valign="top">Twos and threes, I just don''t get it.  What is wrong with this?  Fess up, I won''t hurt you!  why why why why why why?</td>', 'Twos and threes, I just don''t get it.  What is wrong with this?  Fess up, I won''t hurt you!  why why why why why why?', '2003-01-28 15:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
