(215563, 8161, 6405, '<td valign="top">Didn''t get scared from Sony DSC-F717 ,nice shot, i like it!!!</td>', 'Didn''t get scared from Sony DSC-F717 ,nice shot, i like it!!!', '2003-02-14 19:07:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(226408, 7898, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool!  You have a good sense of humor!  The shot is very good, too!  Focus is about perfect, good trick to dim your flash, but try carrying a small piece of gause cloth, it should give you a more evenly dulled flash.  I gave this an 8, but probably should have gone 9!  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Wow, very cool!  You have a good sense of humor!  The shot is very good, too!  Focus is about perfect, good trick to dim your flash, but try carrying a small piece of gause cloth, it should give you a more evenly dulled flash.  I gave this an 8, but probably should have gone 9!  Rob the Swash', '2003-03-01 15:41:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(230490, 7916, 7073, '<td valign="top">I love unicorns!</td>', 'I love unicorns!', '2003-03-06 12:59:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(251388, 7945, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the ''low quality'' effect added by the microsocope - it adds something. I''m sure your daughter will thank for advertising her head lice on the Internet :-)</td>', 'Cool. I like the ''low quality'' effect added by the microsocope - it adds something. I''m sure your daughter will thank for advertising her head lice on the Internet :-)', '2003-04-01 07:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(251408, 7945, 1829, '<td valign="top">Ahhh the ole'' battle of the head lice.  I have kids and I can tell you it''s a constant battle lol.  All in all, I must say I have taken up the battle myself with poisons etc to eliminate those pesty little buggars.  I do feel for you though!!  Great capture.</td>', 'Ahhh the ole'' battle of the head lice.  I have kids and I can tell you it''s a constant battle lol.  All in all, I must say I have taken up the battle myself with poisons etc to eliminate those pesty little buggars.  I do feel for you though!!  Great capture.', '2003-04-01 08:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
